(1419948, 182575, 34659, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to absorb in this photo.  Very nice job.  My only other comment would be that I would have liked to see a little more light in the foreground and that you probably could have smart erased the birds in the clouds.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a spectacular shot.  (9)</td>', 'There''s a lot to absorb in this photo.  Very nice job.  My only other comment would be that I would have liked to see a little more light in the foreground and that you probably could have smart erased the birds in the clouds.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a spectacular shot.  (9)', '2005-05-30 01:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
