(1419954, 183320, 33361, '<td valign="top">need to work on your cloning - the white on his cheek and the shadow around him are distracting</td>', 'need to work on your cloning - the white on his cheek and the shadow around him are distracting', '2005-05-30 01:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419955, 182852, 34659, '<td valign="top">I was surprised at how many airplane entries there were, but yours really stood out from the rest.  My brother is a pilot for FedEx, and although I''m not a big fan of plane shots (no pun intended), this one is truly spectacular.  You did a phenomenal job capturing them.  My only other comment would be that I think I would have scored it a 10 if the colors had been a little brighter.  Great job!  (9)</td>', 'I was surprised at how many airplane entries there were, but yours really stood out from the rest.  My brother is a pilot for FedEx, and although I''m not a big fan of plane shots (no pun intended), this one is truly spectacular.  You did a phenomenal job capturing them.  My only other comment would be that I think I would have scored it a 10 if the colors had been a little brighter.  Great job!  (9)', '2005-05-30 01:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419963, 183004, 18868, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little less sharpening.  The wand/baton/prize needs some type of context to help identify it.</td>', 'Perhaps a little less sharpening.  The wand/baton/prize needs some type of context to help identify it.', '2005-05-30 01:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419964, 182357, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  Boy, that must have been a fast shutter speed - LOL!  My only other comment would be that I would have liked to see the colors turned up a bit.  Don''t get me wrong though - it''s spectacular!  (9)</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  Boy, that must have been a fast shutter speed - LOL!  My only other comment would be that I would have liked to see the colors turned up a bit.  Don''t get me wrong though - it''s spectacular!  (9)', '2005-05-30 01:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419965, 183205, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lucky guy!  She''s beautiful.  Nice DOF and lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Lucky guy!  She''s beautiful.  Nice DOF and lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-30 01:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
