(1419970, 183151, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simply AMAZING shot!  Very well done.  You should be especially pleased with this one (I''m adding it to my Favorites).  I hope you were able to "not disturb" the nest enough that the Momma bird returned - I''m sure you were.  Great lighting, color, clarity...  What else can I say?  (10)</td>', 'Simply AMAZING shot!  Very well done.  You should be especially pleased with this one (I''m adding it to my Favorites).  I hope you were able to "not disturb" the nest enough that the Momma bird returned - I''m sure you were.  Great lighting, color, clarity...  What else can I say?  (10)', '2005-05-30 01:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419971, 183069, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is one of those pictures that makes me say "Wow!" Unbelievable color, texture and clarity. I''m not sure why the right edge of this photo is darker than the rest of it, but that barely detracts from this gorgeous image. Very nicely done!</td>', 'This is one of those pictures that makes me say "Wow!" Unbelievable color, texture and clarity. I''m not sure why the right edge of this photo is darker than the rest of it, but that barely detracts from this gorgeous image. Very nicely done!', '2005-05-30 01:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419972, 183336, 6668, '<td valign="top">Although the rose itself is beautiful I''m not crazy about the straight on composition of this shot, I think it would have worked better from a different angle, also the small white dots on the front petals are very distracting, not sure what they are.</td>', 'Although the rose itself is beautiful I''m not crazy about the straight on composition of this shot, I think it would have worked better from a different angle, also the small white dots on the front petals are very distracting, not sure what they are.', '2005-05-30 01:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
