(1419978, 182762, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The clarity, colors, &amp; composition are wonderful.  It may sound funny, but I''m sure I would have scored it a 10 if the egret looked a little more healthy/kempt.  I''m sure it was just that he/she was dishevelled at the moment, but IMHO it distracted me a little.  Still, a fantastic photo!  (9)</td>', 'Great shot!  The clarity, colors, & composition are wonderful.  It may sound funny, but I''m sure I would have scored it a 10 if the egret looked a little more healthy/kempt.  I''m sure it was just that he/she was dishevelled at the moment, but IMHO it distracted me a little.  Still, a fantastic photo!  (9)', '2005-05-30 01:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
