(1419992, 183042, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simply breathtaking shot...  The haze is a little distracting (but I know you couldn''t do anything about that!).  What a truly beautiful site.  Well done!  (9)</td>', 'Simply breathtaking shot...  The haze is a little distracting (but I know you couldn''t do anything about that!).  What a truly beautiful site.  Well done!  (9)', '2005-05-30 01:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
