(1420010, 183302, 34659, '<td valign="top">At first my thought was, "Okay, this pose has been done..." but I was very pleasantly surprised to see a new emotion in the eyes of the model.  I like your scarf selection and the background.  You captured her eyes wonderfully - they could probably be a little crisper, but I really like this shot.  Very well done.  (8)</td>', 'At first my thought was, "Okay, this pose has been done..." but I was very pleasantly surprised to see a new emotion in the eyes of the model.  I like your scarf selection and the background.  You captured her eyes wonderfully - they could probably be a little crisper, but I really like this shot.  Very well done.  (8)', '2005-05-30 02:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
