(1420016, 182648, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot.  I think you probably could have used a little less light from the left (and perhaps a soft light from the center or right), but the model is appealing, has an obvious attitude that is well captured, and the pose &amp; cropping is good.  Nice job.  (7)</td>', 'I really liked this shot.  I think you probably could have used a little less light from the left (and perhaps a soft light from the center or right), but the model is appealing, has an obvious attitude that is well captured, and the pose & cropping is good.  Nice job.  (7)', '2005-05-30 02:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
