(1420329, 182616, 35352, '<td valign="top">The 2 subjects in this photo go really well together. I can see where you want to go with this. I like who the yellow flower complements the sun. I notice a problem I always have with dodging on the girl''s lips and eyes. Rather than lighten the colour, its painted white onto it and taken away sound of the redness which is a shame.</td>', 'The 2 subjects in this photo go really well together. I can see where you want to go with this. I like who the yellow flower complements the sun. I notice a problem I always have with dodging on the girl''s lips and eyes. Rather than lighten the colour, its painted white onto it and taken away sound of the redness which is a shame.', '2005-05-30 06:41:47.000000', NULL, 1);
