(1420338, 183158, 35352, '<td valign="top">A bold title and some very bold graffiti. The ominous clouds provide a suitable stage to the proceedings.</td>', 'A bold title and some very bold graffiti. The ominous clouds provide a suitable stage to the proceedings.', '2005-05-30 06:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420341, 182720, 35352, '<td valign="top">This photo has great potential. The colours look good and the clouds add some interesting variation to the sky. I would been nice to clone out the tree branches. It would be interesting to see how photos taken minutes later would of turned out.</td>', 'This photo has great potential. The colours look good and the clouds add some interesting variation to the sky. I would been nice to clone out the tree branches. It would be interesting to see how photos taken minutes later would of turned out.', '2005-05-30 06:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420342, 182766, 35352, '<td valign="top">Are you looking at me punk? A beautiful baby and a beautiful photo. I love the green background against the pink bib.</td>', 'Are you looking at me punk? A beautiful baby and a beautiful photo. I love the green background against the pink bib.', '2005-05-30 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420344, 183337, 35352, '<td valign="top">WOW. There are some people who don''t like bold colour but I love it. Especailly in a photo like this where it is dramatic yet not overpowering. The desat of the shore in the forground is excellent to. I wonder what it would look like with the shore cropped out altogether.</td>', 'WOW. There are some people who don''t like bold colour but I love it. Especailly in a photo like this where it is dramatic yet not overpowering. The desat of the shore in the forground is excellent to. I wonder what it would look like with the shore cropped out altogether.', '2005-05-30 06:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420346, 182518, 35352, '<td valign="top">The water looks like light to me. It makes me want to be at this place.</td>', 'The water looks like light to me. It makes me want to be at this place.', '2005-05-30 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
