(1420408, 183074, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like this beauty. The light and tones are interestingly very rich and creates a nice depth and atmoshere. But for some reason I also feel that it''s not complete as it is. I am looking for something in it that''s not there. Probably you have managed to created a world for me and I am trying to bring in a few things I would like to be present in this world.  Well done.</td>', 'I like this beauty. The light and tones are interestingly very rich and creates a nice depth and atmoshere. But for some reason I also feel that it''s not complete as it is. I am looking for something in it that''s not there. Probably you have managed to created a world for me and I am trying to bring in a few things I would like to be present in this world.  Well done.', '2005-05-30 07:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
