(1420501, 183302, 24925, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work for me...the incredibly pampered look of this individual (eyebrows, makeup, supersmooth skin) clashes with the context in which she''s presented...<br/> <br/>She''s got such nice eyes, I would have just taken a photo of her face, as is...<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I like the photo and it looks well toned.  I find the background a bit distracting as well as the red light on her left shoulder...I bet you got some great photos out of this shoot, though!</td>', 'This doesn''t work for me...the incredibly pampered look of this individual (eyebrows, makeup, supersmooth skin) clashes with the context in which she''s presented... She''s got such nice eyes, I would have just taken a photo of her face, as is... Compositionally, I like the photo and it looks well toned.  I find the background a bit distracting as well as the red light on her left shoulder...I bet you got some great photos out of this shoot, though!', '2005-05-30 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420502, 182716, 24925, '<td valign="top">I can''t really see the beauty as much as I''d like to...she has a well toned body but the face is where the beauty is (specifically the eyes, which I just can''t quite see).  It''s a neat idea, with the light pouring in from behind the curtain but it looks a bit too posed and unnatural for me.</td>', 'I can''t really see the beauty as much as I''d like to...she has a well toned body but the face is where the beauty is (specifically the eyes, which I just can''t quite see).  It''s a neat idea, with the light pouring in from behind the curtain but it looks a bit too posed and unnatural for me.', '2005-05-30 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420505, 182977, 24925, '<td valign="top">A close up of a flower needs to really be striking to make an impact with me (and some do) but this one doesn''t quite do it.  It''s usually the lines and lighting that do it for me in a successful version of this shot and both don''t hit me this time.  The shadows are distracting and the lines don''t flow well.</td>', 'A close up of a flower needs to really be striking to make an impact with me (and some do) but this one doesn''t quite do it.  It''s usually the lines and lighting that do it for me in a successful version of this shot and both don''t hit me this time.  The shadows are distracting and the lines don''t flow well.', '2005-05-30 09:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
