(1420573, 182261, 27482, '<td valign="top">At last something original...  I like this shot a lot but still not jaw droppingly awesome.  I personally think that the selective desat doesn´t help this image, the same goes for the dull grey backround but all things considered this is pretty cool and I like it, gave it an 8.  With a more vivid but out of focus backround and all in colour I would possibly have given this a 10 so great imagination and work on your behalf.</td>', 'At last something original...  I like this shot a lot but still not jaw droppingly awesome.  I personally think that the selective desat doesn´t help this image, the same goes for the dull grey backround but all things considered this is pretty cool and I like it, gave it an 8.  With a more vivid but out of focus backround and all in colour I would possibly have given this a 10 so great imagination and work on your behalf.', '2005-05-30 10:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420575, 182575, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot!  I guess that this is Chicaco although I have never been there.  Anyway, love the colours/contrast/sharpness in this shot and that sky is lovely, a very nice city scape shot and it makes me want to come over for a quick visit in your city.  I would however have liked to see more of the right side too, I somewhat feel as if this is only a left part of a photo and you cut half of it away but that is just nitpicking and I love it as it is.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot!  I guess that this is Chicaco although I have never been there.  Anyway, love the colours/contrast/sharpness in this shot and that sky is lovely, a very nice city scape shot and it makes me want to come over for a quick visit in your city.  I would however have liked to see more of the right side too, I somewhat feel as if this is only a left part of a photo and you cut half of it away but that is just nitpicking and I love it as it is.', '2005-05-30 10:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420578, 183085, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious and this image works.  Would not be surprised to see this close to the top as images such as this normally do well but not quite my cup of tea but still very nice, I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Very mysterious and this image works.  Would not be surprised to see this close to the top as images such as this normally do well but not quite my cup of tea but still very nice, I gave it a 7.', '2005-05-30 10:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
