(1420721, 183222, 34247, '<td valign="top">A striking pose/composition. The overexposure on the sky is a tad much, I feel, and the shoe laces are getting my eyes. I particularly like the hands, both the one that appears joined with the ball and the spread fingers on the other. Quite expressive. There''s a tuft of leaves right on top of the shed/building roof on the right side that''s also catching a little. But nice all the same.</td>', 'A striking pose/composition. The overexposure on the sky is a tad much, I feel, and the shoe laces are getting my eyes. I particularly like the hands, both the one that appears joined with the ball and the spread fingers on the other. Quite expressive. There''s a tuft of leaves right on top of the shed/building roof on the right side that''s also catching a little. But nice all the same.', '2005-05-30 12:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1420724, 182972, 34247, '<td valign="top">Background is way too busy for my taste, and here''s an example where better bokeh would have helped. The selective desat also doesn''t quite work here, imho.</td>', 'Background is way too busy for my taste, and here''s an example where better bokeh would have helped. The selective desat also doesn''t quite work here, imho.', '2005-05-30 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
