(1420832, 182997, 9111, '<td valign="top">The butter soft colors and shallow DOF of this photo are beautiful.   <br/>I would like to see a stronger light on the pollen,  the DOF makes them almost blend in to the background and breings the dark colors on the stamen more predominate.  and makes them look burnt on my monitor.    If the soft pinks and yellows of this were brightened up to bring them foreward  I think this would score a lot higher. <br/></td>', 'The butter soft colors and shallow DOF of this photo are beautiful.   I would like to see a stronger light on the pollen,  the DOF makes them almost blend in to the background and breings the dark colors on the stamen more predominate.  and makes them look burnt on my monitor.    If the soft pinks and yellows of this were brightened up to bring them foreward  I think this would score a lot higher. ', '2005-05-30 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
