(1421213, 183085, 35804, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and color...completely magical...the softness is so elegant...completely beautiful.</td>', 'Lovely light and color...completely magical...the softness is so elegant...completely beautiful.', '2005-05-30 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
