(1421223, 182772, 35804, '<td valign="top">This reminds me so much of an old painting...those lovely pastoral landscapes...exqusite light and texture...a really beautiful subtle serene image.</td>', 'This reminds me so much of an old painting...those lovely pastoral landscapes...exqusite light and texture...a really beautiful subtle serene image.', '2005-05-30 16:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421225, 183226, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun image! I''m lovin'' those polka dots, and the pink to boot!</td>', 'This is such a fun image! I''m lovin'' those polka dots, and the pink to boot!', '2005-05-30 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421226, 183195, 35804, '<td valign="top">That light is gorgeous! Excellent clarity...truly luminous.</td>', 'That light is gorgeous! Excellent clarity...truly luminous.', '2005-05-30 16:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421229, 183066, 327, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Wonderful lens, good composition.</td>', 'Excellent. Wonderful lens, good composition.', '2005-05-30 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421233, 183242, 327, '<td valign="top">While I find this cat very cute I think your focus is a bit too soft. There is very little detail seen. Not sure what these grey cats are called..if anything, but I see them often and have always love their beautiful fur.</td>', 'While I find this cat very cute I think your focus is a bit too soft. There is very little detail seen. Not sure what these grey cats are called..if anything, but I see them often and have always love their beautiful fur.', '2005-05-30 16:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421236, 182903, 327, '<td valign="top">No doubt this is beautiful. A new life, perfect, sweet. I think the hand is a distraction but do love the babies eye''s and perfect little face.</td>', 'No doubt this is beautiful. A new life, perfect, sweet. I think the hand is a distraction but do love the babies eye''s and perfect little face.', '2005-05-30 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421237, 183303, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best images of the challenge. Very well done. Reminiscent of kosmikkreeper''s blue ribbon winning image, "Nature''s Spirals", from the three''s challenge. I''d consider a slightly greater DOF and place the bud center just inside the lower left ROT intersection point like in jmsetzler''s ribbon winning image image "Pianissimo".<br/></td>', 'This is one of the best images of the challenge. Very well done. Reminiscent of kosmikkreeper''s blue ribbon winning image, "Nature''s Spirals", from the three''s challenge. I''d consider a slightly greater DOF and place the bud center just inside the lower left ROT intersection point like in jmsetzler''s ribbon winning image image "Pianissimo".', '2005-05-30 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421258, 183325, 38264, '<td valign="top">Nice color...</td>', 'Nice color...', '2005-05-30 16:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421260, 182902, 38264, '<td valign="top">Great blend...</td>', 'Great blend...', '2005-05-30 16:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421266, 182743, 38264, '<td valign="top">The color blend is great...the foreground of water set the photo off.</td>', 'The color blend is great...the foreground of water set the photo off.', '2005-05-30 16:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421267, 183161, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice! And, it compares very well with the hundreds of photos that I''ve taken of this location. :)</td>', 'Very nice! And, it compares very well with the hundreds of photos that I''ve taken of this location. :)', '2005-05-30 16:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421273, 182174, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic cloud formation that is effectively presented. Wish you would have had a more interesting foreground for that sky. It still should be a top finisher and will make a perfect sky replacement for the right landscape image.</td>', 'Very dramatic cloud formation that is effectively presented. Wish you would have had a more interesting foreground for that sky. It still should be a top finisher and will make a perfect sky replacement for the right landscape image.', '2005-05-30 16:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421276, 182550, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well setup image. Good lighting. One of the best images of the challenge. Very professional look with your model''s pose and the way the red background gives way to the dark shadow on the left. I''d clone out the rabbit ears emerging from the bra and the slightly dark shadow on the red just right of her forearm. I''m probably not keeping up with the times but navel jewelry is a distraction in this image to me. You capture beauty in a very erotic and effective way. Great job.</td>', 'Exceptionally well setup image. Good lighting. One of the best images of the challenge. Very professional look with your model''s pose and the way the red background gives way to the dark shadow on the left. I''d clone out the rabbit ears emerging from the bra and the slightly dark shadow on the red just right of her forearm. I''m probably not keeping up with the times but navel jewelry is a distraction in this image to me. You capture beauty in a very erotic and effective way. Great job.', '2005-05-30 16:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421279, 183031, 37005, '<td valign="top">Nice detail &amp; DOF</td>', 'Nice detail & DOF', '2005-05-30 16:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421280, 183066, 16230, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene! Very well done!</td>', 'What a beautiful scene! Very well done!', '2005-05-30 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421282, 183323, 37005, '<td valign="top">I love the unusual vantage point.  A little grainy but well done.</td>', 'I love the unusual vantage point.  A little grainy but well done.', '2005-05-30 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421283, 183206, 16230, '<td valign="top">Cute girl and a nice smile. I love the flying hair. Well done!</td>', 'Cute girl and a nice smile. I love the flying hair. Well done!', '2005-05-30 16:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421285, 182648, 37005, '<td valign="top">&lt;fanning self&gt;  <br/> <br/>er...nice.  :-D</td>', '<fanning self>   er...nice.  :-D', '2005-05-30 16:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421288, 183158, 37005, '<td valign="top">Oh! Love the title.  Great use varying saturations.</td>', 'Oh! Love the title.  Great use varying saturations.', '2005-05-30 16:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421289, 183336, 37005, '<td valign="top">The lighting/flash exposure is a bit harsh.   Otherwise lovely photo.</td>', 'The lighting/flash exposure is a bit harsh.   Otherwise lovely photo.', '2005-05-30 16:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421291, 182763, 37005, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Two cliches = Beauty!!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Two cliches = Beauty!!', '2005-05-30 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421292, 183205, 16230, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait. The crop seems a bit unbalanced to me though.</td>', 'A very nice portrait. The crop seems a bit unbalanced to me though.', '2005-05-30 16:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421295, 183337, 37005, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but I think the water lacks depth/interest.</td>', 'I really like this shot but I think the water lacks depth/interest.', '2005-05-30 16:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421297, 183294, 37005, '<td valign="top">Oh this photo is cool.  ALmost feels retro!</td>', 'Oh this photo is cool.  ALmost feels retro!', '2005-05-30 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421301, 182357, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! And so difficult to capture too. Well done! My one nitpick would be the background. It''s nicely out of focus, but too close to the bird''s coloring to really allow the bird to stand out. Really a great photo though!</td>', 'Wonderful! And so difficult to capture too. Well done! My one nitpick would be the background. It''s nicely out of focus, but too close to the bird''s coloring to really allow the bird to stand out. Really a great photo though!', '2005-05-30 17:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421302, 183299, 16230, '<td valign="top">This has a very nice dreamy look. Well done!</td>', 'This has a very nice dreamy look. Well done!', '2005-05-30 17:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421304, 182281, 16230, '<td valign="top">A wonderful capture! Love the sharp focus, detail, and color. Well done!</td>', 'A wonderful capture! Love the sharp focus, detail, and color. Well done!', '2005-05-30 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421309, 183333, 33947, '<td valign="top">The cat is a sweetie, but, the feet have got to go!!</td>', 'The cat is a sweetie, but, the feet have got to go!!', '2005-05-30 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421313, 183154, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has decent color contrast and composed well for the angle from which it is taken. Overall this is not a bad picture.<br/> <br/>However, this would be more interesting if the flowers were taken from the side rather than from above. From above gives it more of a snapshot quality. It has background noise that should be removed. If you shot with a little more DOF the lower left flower would be in sharp focus. But if you have to make a choice then the closest flower to the camera is best to have in sharper focus rather than the stem just behind the flowers. Judicious use of dodge and burn would add more contrast and depth to the image which would make it more dramatic and interesting for the viewer.<br/> <br/>The image, "Complements", in this challenge is a great example to learn from.</td>', 'This image has decent color contrast and composed well for the angle from which it is taken. Overall this is not a bad picture. However, this would be more interesting if the flowers were taken from the side rather than from above. From above gives it more of a snapshot quality. It has background noise that should be removed. If you shot with a little more DOF the lower left flower would be in sharp focus. But if you have to make a choice then the closest flower to the camera is best to have in sharper focus rather than the stem just behind the flowers. Judicious use of dodge and burn would add more contrast and depth to the image which would make it more dramatic and interesting for the viewer. The image, "Complements", in this challenge is a great example to learn from.', '2005-05-30 17:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421315, 182952, 37005, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Compelling &amp; beautiful.</td>', 'Wow.  Compelling & beautiful.', '2005-05-30 17:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421316, 183059, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this view. Your white is so nice and white and the red ribbon is fantastic. What a great shot. She IS beautiful.</td>', 'Love this view. Your white is so nice and white and the red ribbon is fantastic. What a great shot. She IS beautiful.', '2005-05-30 17:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421319, 183042, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the view, it''s beautiful!</td>', 'Love the view, it''s beautiful!', '2005-05-30 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421323, 183320, 327, '<td valign="top">Little cutie pie! Some reflection on the right..? Window or something but the focus could be a bit stronger.I don''t really think this composition is the best it could be.  I''m guessing this is taken in front of a screen..? Anyway cute little guy, great smile and he''s for sure beautiful.</td>', 'Little cutie pie! Some reflection on the right..? Window or something but the focus could be a bit stronger.I don''t really think this composition is the best it could be.  I''m guessing this is taken in front of a screen..? Anyway cute little guy, great smile and he''s for sure beautiful.', '2005-05-30 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421325, 183137, 327, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit purple. The magenta is very strong..maybe from shadows or from the camera. I do like this beautiful deer.</td>', 'Seems a bit purple. The magenta is very strong..maybe from shadows or from the camera. I do like this beautiful deer.', '2005-05-30 17:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421335, 183340, 5792, '<td valign="top">Overall the framing of this image with the palm trees is excellent. This image is begging to have something or someone in the foreground just left of the palm shadows as a main subject. Unfortunately, the post processing might have harmed the image more than making it more interesting. It also looks like the horizon is not quite level and high on the left side.</td>', 'Overall the framing of this image with the palm trees is excellent. This image is begging to have something or someone in the foreground just left of the palm shadows as a main subject. Unfortunately, the post processing might have harmed the image more than making it more interesting. It also looks like the horizon is not quite level and high on the left side.', '2005-05-30 17:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421352, 182973, 5792, '<td valign="top">The shadow streamers just above the horizon are the strongest part of the image. Though it was your specific intention the silver lining is overexposed. If you could have "narrowed" the thickness of the silver lining it would be more effective. The foreground does not have a lot of interest to complement the sky. If you could find buildings or vegetation to frame the sky center to a much larger degree it would add a lot of interest to the composition and justify the large amount of foreground silhouette you already have.</td>', 'The shadow streamers just above the horizon are the strongest part of the image. Though it was your specific intention the silver lining is overexposed. If you could have "narrowed" the thickness of the silver lining it would be more effective. The foreground does not have a lot of interest to complement the sky. If you could find buildings or vegetation to frame the sky center to a much larger degree it would add a lot of interest to the composition and justify the large amount of foreground silhouette you already have.', '2005-05-30 17:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421357, 183337, 811, '<td valign="top">Great sky, but the land in the distance looks a bit artifacty to me.</td>', 'Great sky, but the land in the distance looks a bit artifacty to me.', '2005-05-30 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421358, 183286, 811, '<td valign="top">Great dof.</td>', 'Great dof.', '2005-05-30 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421359, 183199, 811, '<td valign="top">The detail is good, but the composition is a bit centered.</td>', 'The detail is good, but the composition is a bit centered.', '2005-05-30 17:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421364, 183080, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.  Black and white gives it a dreamy feel.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.  Black and white gives it a dreamy feel.', '2005-05-30 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421372, 182770, 5792, '<td valign="top">Conceptually this is a very good idea and the white background is great.<br/> <br/>The general technical quality of the beauty aides pictured is not particularly good. I''m unsure what to do about that. One thing you consider is to shoot at a shallow DOF and set the beauty aides at different distances from the camera so that some are in sharp focus and others are soft focused. Also, put some powder on the brush and add the applicators to the two open containers to make it look as though they have just been used. This would imply that beauty has just been created and is very nearby without actually showing it. That is powerful.  It would make me think the user of those products is both gorgeous and glamorous and someone I''d like to meet!</td>', 'Conceptually this is a very good idea and the white background is great. The general technical quality of the beauty aides pictured is not particularly good. I''m unsure what to do about that. One thing you consider is to shoot at a shallow DOF and set the beauty aides at different distances from the camera so that some are in sharp focus and others are soft focused. Also, put some powder on the brush and add the applicators to the two open containers to make it look as though they have just been used. This would imply that beauty has just been created and is very nearby without actually showing it. That is powerful.  It would make me think the user of those products is both gorgeous and glamorous and someone I''d like to meet!', '2005-05-30 17:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421379, 181438, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but, it''s hard to see the beauty in narcissism. 5</td>', 'Interesting shot, but, it''s hard to see the beauty in narcissism. 5', '2005-05-30 17:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421385, 183137, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors look a bit off to me -- the greens are too saturated, I think.</td>', 'The colors look a bit off to me -- the greens are too saturated, I think.', '2005-05-30 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421387, 183137, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has a great background and is composed exceptionally well. This image had potential.<br/> <br/>The general low technical quality of the image will prevent it from getting a high score. The color balance of the deer seems off. It is too blue. The DOF of the deer itself is shallow which makes the snout out of focus. Overall clarity of the image is poor.<br/> <br/>Wish your camera could have captured this image better. It is really a good shot.</td>', 'This image has a great background and is composed exceptionally well. This image had potential. The general low technical quality of the image will prevent it from getting a high score. The color balance of the deer seems off. It is too blue. The DOF of the deer itself is shallow which makes the snout out of focus. Overall clarity of the image is poor. Wish your camera could have captured this image better. It is really a good shot.', '2005-05-30 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421394, 182763, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot! I wish we had so colorful butterflies in my country;-) It is crystal clear where it should and out of focus where it should. Well done!</td>', 'This is a stunning shot! I wish we had so colorful butterflies in my country;-) It is crystal clear where it should and out of focus where it should. Well done!', '2005-05-30 17:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421397, 183072, 27901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but a bit grainy.</td>', 'Beautiful but a bit grainy.', '2005-05-30 17:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421400, 183082, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is artistic shot, I like the idea very much but think it would be stronger if the eye is more to the left, The left part of the picture when it is like this is something as a waisted space, if on the right it is more an area the is looking at.</td>', 'This is artistic shot, I like the idea very much but think it would be stronger if the eye is more to the left, The left part of the picture when it is like this is something as a waisted space, if on the right it is more an area the is looking at.', '2005-05-30 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421402, 183302, 27901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, the eyes are so clear and although the off focus area would be better if solid color. Great work though!</td>', 'Beautiful picture, the eyes are so clear and although the off focus area would be better if solid color. Great work though!', '2005-05-30 17:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421404, 181290, 27901, '<td valign="top">Very good, I like the idea but it would be better in my opinion if she would be looking into the picture.</td>', 'Very good, I like the idea but it would be better in my opinion if she would be looking into the picture.', '2005-05-30 17:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421406, 183021, 27901, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like insect shots. But it is a bit highlighted and the face could be more clear. But insects are tricky things to photograph.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like insect shots. But it is a bit highlighted and the face could be more clear. But insects are tricky things to photograph.', '2005-05-30 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421409, 182918, 24314, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful little dog (",)</td>', 'what a beautiful little dog (",)', '2005-05-30 17:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421412, 181561, 27901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog! I like the eye color so different. The weak point in this picture is the empty space on the left if you cropped a bit off it and maybe little of the bottom the dog would be much stronger.</td>', 'Beautiful dog! I like the eye color so different. The weak point in this picture is the empty space on the left if you cropped a bit off it and maybe little of the bottom the dog would be much stronger.', '2005-05-30 17:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421413, 183205, 24314, '<td valign="top">gorgeous lady, but I would have loved to have seen her full smile. stunning</td>', 'gorgeous lady, but I would have loved to have seen her full smile. stunning', '2005-05-30 17:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421418, 183067, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, great lightning, good idea but there lack the flower to catch my eye, I think that using the rule of third to place some of the stronger flowers there might make it stronger. But it is just my humble opinion and I am not very good at this.</td>', 'Great contrast, great lightning, good idea but there lack the flower to catch my eye, I think that using the rule of third to place some of the stronger flowers there might make it stronger. But it is just my humble opinion and I am not very good at this.', '2005-05-30 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421421, 183087, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I have been photographing foals lately and I know how difficult it can be to get their fur right. Well done. I who love cropping would have cropped it more close and leave the little "thingie" out of the picture and more of the legs.</td>', 'Great picture, I have been photographing foals lately and I know how difficult it can be to get their fur right. Well done. I who love cropping would have cropped it more close and leave the little "thingie" out of the picture and more of the legs.', '2005-05-30 18:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421424, 182281, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great shot, lovely texture, although it is mathing the color in the background in a way it has something special about it that makes it great. The lines in the leaves are clear and the work is good on this one.</td>', 'Great shot, lovely texture, although it is mathing the color in the background in a way it has something special about it that makes it great. The lines in the leaves are clear and the work is good on this one.', '2005-05-30 18:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421426, 181357, 24314, '<td valign="top">crisp clear and gorgeous</td>', 'crisp clear and gorgeous', '2005-05-30 18:04:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1421429, 182952, 27901, '<td valign="top">The hair on this mom makes this picture like the child is resting in a flower. I love the color of this hair although I suppose I wouldn''t love it on my children to be frank. Great shot catching the athmosphere.</td>', 'The hair on this mom makes this picture like the child is resting in a flower. I love the color of this hair although I suppose I wouldn''t love it on my children to be frank. Great shot catching the athmosphere.', '2005-05-30 18:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421431, 182843, 24314, '<td valign="top">wow, amazing</td>', 'wow, amazing', '2005-05-30 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421434, 183295, 27901, '<td valign="top">Flowers are lovely to shoot with macro lens, this is well done although it would be nice to see the veins in the petals better the artistic flavour is also making a good impression.</td>', 'Flowers are lovely to shoot with macro lens, this is well done although it would be nice to see the veins in the petals better the artistic flavour is also making a good impression.', '2005-05-30 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421437, 182997, 27901, '<td valign="top">At first I thought "nah" but before I finished my voting the picture started to catch my eye better. The lines are great and it is a very artistic view of a flower. What really changed my voting was that I would love this one on my wall;-) There is more in this one than one expects right away. It is sad that usually we vote fast because we have to vote on many pictures because this one needs time. Good luck with it.</td>', 'At first I thought "nah" but before I finished my voting the picture started to catch my eye better. The lines are great and it is a very artistic view of a flower. What really changed my voting was that I would love this one on my wall;-) There is more in this one than one expects right away. It is sad that usually we vote fast because we have to vote on many pictures because this one needs time. Good luck with it.', '2005-05-30 18:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421440, 182649, 27901, '<td valign="top">The legs are rather unrealisticly red, but then I like unrealistic colors;-) Good shot.</td>', 'The legs are rather unrealisticly red, but then I like unrealistic colors;-) Good shot.', '2005-05-30 18:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421442, 183066, 27901, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful place, but this picture somehow remind me of a computer game. I am not sure why, maybe because some details are minning. A bit to light in the back but beautiful and the position is good.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful place, but this picture somehow remind me of a computer game. I am not sure why, maybe because some details are minning. A bit to light in the back but beautiful and the position is good.', '2005-05-30 18:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421448, 182772, 27901, '<td valign="top">The rear end of sheeps hasn''t been something I have looked for but this really has potential. They are though to centered on this photo for my taste and some disturbance in the foreground. Cropping of the left and bottom might make it better.</td>', 'The rear end of sheeps hasn''t been something I have looked for but this really has potential. They are though to centered on this photo for my taste and some disturbance in the foreground. Cropping of the left and bottom might make it better.', '2005-05-30 18:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421450, 183188, 24314, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2005-05-30 18:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421452, 183319, 27901, '<td valign="top">Bit to much contrast but what a color. It is artistic but not well enough detailed where it should like around the insects face. But this is difficult to get so I know it is something special, but having all this food around your face...</td>', 'Bit to much contrast but what a color. It is artistic but not well enough detailed where it should like around the insects face. But this is difficult to get so I know it is something special, but having all this food around your face...', '2005-05-30 18:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421457, 181311, 27901, '<td valign="top">Artistic yes, will take some time to think about this one, maybe the thing that is not working for me is that the flower that should catch the most attention is so centered but the other blue flowers line into it so it works in a way. I would have cropped it from the right and bottom but I am not sure if I would be right doing that.</td>', 'Artistic yes, will take some time to think about this one, maybe the thing that is not working for me is that the flower that should catch the most attention is so centered but the other blue flowers line into it so it works in a way. I would have cropped it from the right and bottom but I am not sure if I would be right doing that.', '2005-05-30 18:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421459, 183192, 27901, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is great shot in a beautiful surrounding. The details of the feathers are great. Well done it isn''t easy to get this!</td>', 'Oh my, this is great shot in a beautiful surrounding. The details of the feathers are great. Well done it isn''t easy to get this!', '2005-05-30 18:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421460, 182219, 27901, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t surprise me if this one is from Iceland, but maybe more places have the same fauna at this time of the year. Great work with the water!</td>', 'Wouldn''t surprise me if this one is from Iceland, but maybe more places have the same fauna at this time of the year. Great work with the water!', '2005-05-30 18:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
