(1421923, 183323, 30018, '<td valign="top">Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.  I''m quite sure that there is a special beauty in this image based on the closeness of these two children, but...for me, this image lacks real interest.  There are some nice qualities about the photo, such as the wonderful range of gray tones, and the contrast, and even the movement diagonally across the page, but as far as "beauty" is concerned, I fail to see how it applies to this image as an image standing on it''s own merit, and without know the people in the photo.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.  I''m quite sure that there is a special beauty in this image based on the closeness of these two children, but...for me, this image lacks real interest.  There are some nice qualities about the photo, such as the wonderful range of gray tones, and the contrast, and even the movement diagonally across the page, but as far as "beauty" is concerned, I fail to see how it applies to this image as an image standing on it''s own merit, and without know the people in the photo.  <5>', '2005-05-30 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
