(1422322, 182357, 4226, '<td valign="top">Great capture.. what was your shutter speed ? you have frozen those wings !! I have tried that but most of the times I end up with shutter speeds around 200 or 400 and this doesn''t freeze the wings.. <br/>I wonder how they will look with a little saturation bumped up background.  Very well captured. 8</td>', 'Great capture.. what was your shutter speed ? you have frozen those wings !! I have tried that but most of the times I end up with shutter speeds around 200 or 400 and this doesn''t freeze the wings.. I wonder how they will look with a little saturation bumped up background.  Very well captured. 8', '2005-05-31 03:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
