(1422423, 183270, 31307, '<td valign="top">...whoa.  Creepy.  It feels a little too dark (the lighting I mean.  The subject certainly is), though.  I kind of find it hard to see the beauty in this.  That is to say, I don''t see any and I don''t have the volition to bullshit myself and see something that, for all I can tell, isn''t there and perhaps wasn''t intended to be there.  The title hints that the beautiful thing is love, but this is a twisted and sick love.<br/> <br/>All that said, I commend you for your ability to create shots that "kick you in the gut" like this one does.</td>', '...whoa.  Creepy.  It feels a little too dark (the lighting I mean.  The subject certainly is), though.  I kind of find it hard to see the beauty in this.  That is to say, I don''t see any and I don''t have the volition to bullshit myself and see something that, for all I can tell, isn''t there and perhaps wasn''t intended to be there.  The title hints that the beautiful thing is love, but this is a twisted and sick love. All that said, I commend you for your ability to create shots that "kick you in the gut" like this one does.', '2005-05-31 06:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422428, 182906, 31307, '<td valign="top">I''m predicting top, well, certainly 10, but maybe even a ribbon?  We''ll see.  This is an awesome shot.  I really like how it''s simple and yet my eye was drawn right to it despite being among a bunch of others on the entries overview page.  Dang.  What a nice capture...</td>', 'I''m predicting top, well, certainly 10, but maybe even a ribbon?  We''ll see.  This is an awesome shot.  I really like how it''s simple and yet my eye was drawn right to it despite being among a bunch of others on the entries overview page.  Dang.  What a nice capture...', '2005-05-31 06:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
