(1422498, 183265, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice color, nice reflection in the pupil, wonderful detail which includes even the tiniest of hairs, but to be honest, looking at an eye up this close, or should I say having an eye look at me this close, is a bit creepy.  I really don''t feel that an image of an eye up this close is of any interest unless you are an eye doctor.  I feel it would have been much more interesting, and  a stronger image if it did not occupy the entire photo.    &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Nice color, nice reflection in the pupil, wonderful detail which includes even the tiniest of hairs, but to be honest, looking at an eye up this close, or should I say having an eye look at me this close, is a bit creepy.  I really don''t feel that an image of an eye up this close is of any interest unless you are an eye doctor.  I feel it would have been much more interesting, and  a stronger image if it did not occupy the entire photo.    <5>', '2005-05-31 07:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
