(1422506, 182716, 30018, '<td valign="top">an extremely beautiful model (please pass on my admiration) , but I would have like to have seen less of her.  Yes, less.  Cropped a little closer, into a square image, just above the waist, would have been a stronger image in my view.  Its always bad to crop an image at a joint as you did here with her knees.  I hope at some point you will be doing a close up of her face, as it is simply radiant.  Would love to see those incredible blue eyes!  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'an extremely beautiful model (please pass on my admiration) , but I would have like to have seen less of her.  Yes, less.  Cropped a little closer, into a square image, just above the waist, would have been a stronger image in my view.  Its always bad to crop an image at a joint as you did here with her knees.  I hope at some point you will be doing a close up of her face, as it is simply radiant.  Would love to see those incredible blue eyes!  <7>', '2005-05-31 07:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
