(1422517, 182903, 30018, '<td valign="top">There is certainly nothing in the world more beautiful than your first born.  Although this is probably not a winner in the contest, it is a very nice baby picture and I''m sure it is a winner in your family already.  Congratulations on a nice picture, and a on your "first" prize.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'There is certainly nothing in the world more beautiful than your first born.  Although this is probably not a winner in the contest, it is a very nice baby picture and I''m sure it is a winner in your family already.  Congratulations on a nice picture, and a on your "first" prize.  <6>', '2005-05-31 07:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422520, 183222, 6999, '<td valign="top">The sharpening halo around this image is quite strong - a smaller radius of USM would work wonders, I should think; though of course it might just be  a camera setting. It''s a reasonably interesting silhouette - and certainly catches the right moment compositionally. I think I''d have preferred a perfect silhouette, rather than the very dark sense of the guy''s face and clothes there is here.</td>', 'The sharpening halo around this image is quite strong - a smaller radius of USM would work wonders, I should think; though of course it might just be  a camera setting. It''s a reasonably interesting silhouette - and certainly catches the right moment compositionally. I think I''d have preferred a perfect silhouette, rather than the very dark sense of the guy''s face and clothes there is here.', '2005-05-31 07:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422522, 181290, 30018, '<td valign="top">Where''s she going.  Looks like this model is walking out of the image.  Although this is a very attractive or beautiful model, and the photo techniques seem nice with some very warm but washed out colors, this image falters in my opion because my eye and my mind sees her leaving the image.  &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'Where''s she going.  Looks like this model is walking out of the image.  Although this is a very attractive or beautiful model, and the photo techniques seem nice with some very warm but washed out colors, this image falters in my opion because my eye and my mind sees her leaving the image.  <4>', '2005-05-31 07:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422523, 183151, 30018, '<td valign="top">Innocence and dependence...along with some beauitul lighting, color and textures, really make this a nice image.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Innocence and dependence...along with some beauitul lighting, color and textures, really make this a nice image.  <7>', '2005-05-31 08:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422526, 182174, 6999, '<td valign="top">Blimey, that''s mad. Good overall sense of tones, though the over-blown areas in the main cloud, although very small, are a shame in my eyes. There''s a strangeness in the contrasting of the unusual sky and the so-very-humdrum world below: almost as though this is about aspiration and ambition.</td>', 'Blimey, that''s mad. Good overall sense of tones, though the over-blown areas in the main cloud, although very small, are a shame in my eyes. There''s a strangeness in the contrasting of the unusual sky and the so-very-humdrum world below: almost as though this is about aspiration and ambition.', '2005-05-31 08:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422527, 183205, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful model, with a great smile, in a traditional pose, which makes this image good rather than great.  If this were American Idol, this would be good enough to get through to the next round, but probably would not win.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very beautiful model, with a great smile, in a traditional pose, which makes this image good rather than great.  If this were American Idol, this would be good enough to get through to the next round, but probably would not win.  <7>', '2005-05-31 08:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422530, 182868, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice color, interesting pose.  Good looking young man as well..  I''m wondering about the glow around the right side of the of the image.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice color, interesting pose.  Good looking young man as well..  I''m wondering about the glow around the right side of the of the image.  <7>', '2005-05-31 08:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422534, 182972, 6999, '<td valign="top">The head-on flash adds a few very very strong shadows, whilst removing most sense of texture from the flower itself. You have at least managed to keep the detail there, even though I would say that bloom is over-exposed. The de-sat? Whilst well done, I just findd it strange in a composition where one would have thought the flower ought to stand out on it''s own.</td>', 'The head-on flash adds a few very very strong shadows, whilst removing most sense of texture from the flower itself. You have at least managed to keep the detail there, even though I would say that bloom is over-exposed. The de-sat? Whilst well done, I just findd it strange in a composition where one would have thought the flower ought to stand out on it''s own.', '2005-05-31 08:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422535, 182188, 25355, '<td valign="top">well, there''s a horse of a different colour</td>', 'well, there''s a horse of a different colour', '2005-05-31 08:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422537, 182646, 30018, '<td valign="top">Attractive model, but the lighting is rather dramatic, which decreases the overall "beauty" of this image.  The pose which has her looking at the light source, almost makes her look startled.  To me, this actually looks like it could have come from and Alfred Hitchcock movie rather than a beauty challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Attractive model, but the lighting is rather dramatic, which decreases the overall "beauty" of this image.  The pose which has her looking at the light source, almost makes her look startled.  To me, this actually looks like it could have come from and Alfred Hitchcock movie rather than a beauty challenge.  <5>', '2005-05-31 08:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422538, 183324, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.  Nicely composed, with incredible colors.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.  Nicely composed, with incredible colors.  <9>', '2005-05-31 08:15:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1422549, 182752, 6999, '<td valign="top">The light, certainly on the beach and sea and trees, is very fine: a pity you couldn''t control it in the clouds a little more. The composition is a tricky one to judge, I would think: I''m not certain you''ve made the right choices - to my eye, the strongest element of this scene is the sweep of darkness from the far headland roudn through image left and down to the foreground, but it''s become cut off in the foreground in order to maintain the entirety of the clouds; that darker area should, i think, have enclosed the idyllic-looking beachfront, given it a feel of protection, and enhanced the image considerably.</td>', 'The light, certainly on the beach and sea and trees, is very fine: a pity you couldn''t control it in the clouds a little more. The composition is a tricky one to judge, I would think: I''m not certain you''ve made the right choices - to my eye, the strongest element of this scene is the sweep of darkness from the far headland roudn through image left and down to the foreground, but it''s become cut off in the foreground in order to maintain the entirety of the clouds; that darker area should, i think, have enclosed the idyllic-looking beachfront, given it a feel of protection, and enhanced the image considerably.', '2005-05-31 08:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422583, 183139, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad capture and I like the composition but the post processing could be better.  Specifically IMHO you should increase the contrast and adjust white balance, it seems a little bit too warm and finally sharpen it.</td>', 'Not a bad capture and I like the composition but the post processing could be better.  Specifically IMHO you should increase the contrast and adjust white balance, it seems a little bit too warm and finally sharpen it.', '2005-05-31 08:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422586, 182763, 27482, '<td valign="top">Easily the best butterfly/flower shot in the challenge IMO.  However it´s not very original and frankly I find it a bit boring but I love the saturation, bokeh, sharpness and contrast in this shot, technically it´s very well done.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Easily the best butterfly/flower shot in the challenge IMO.  However it´s not very original and frankly I find it a bit boring but I love the saturation, bokeh, sharpness and contrast in this shot, technically it´s very well done.  I gave it an 8.', '2005-05-31 09:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422589, 182892, 27482, '<td valign="top">Marbo I presume?  Like this shot a lot but still not as good as your entry in the last free study.  Very good though, just feel that you need some main focal point as my eye wanders all over the frame.  Great job though, way better than most shots in the challenge and you got a 7 from me, whoever you are.</td>', 'Marbo I presume?  Like this shot a lot but still not as good as your entry in the last free study.  Very good though, just feel that you need some main focal point as my eye wanders all over the frame.  Great job though, way better than most shots in the challenge and you got a 7 from me, whoever you are.', '2005-05-31 09:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422590, 183181, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow!  One of the best sunsets in the challenge.  Especially love the silhouettes on the birds on the water and the silhouettes of the palm trees.  Makes me want to be there :)</td>', 'Wow!  One of the best sunsets in the challenge.  Especially love the silhouettes on the birds on the water and the silhouettes of the palm trees.  Makes me want to be there :)', '2005-05-31 09:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422593, 182357, 29154, '<td valign="top">Wow ! What a capture ! Congrats</td>', 'Wow ! What a capture ! Congrats', '2005-05-31 09:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422596, 183336, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful rose!!!</td>', 'What a beautiful rose!!!', '2005-05-31 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422597, 183335, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is truly lovely - great reflection. I like the silhouette of the single bird.</td>', 'This is truly lovely - great reflection. I like the silhouette of the single bird.', '2005-05-31 09:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422598, 182761, 15711, '<td valign="top">Superb shot!</td>', 'Superb shot!', '2005-05-31 09:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422599, 183274, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this is a perfect 10!!!  BRAVO!!</td>', 'I think this is a perfect 10!!!  BRAVO!!', '2005-05-31 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422602, 183229, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the red background against the peacock feather. Very nice.</td>', 'I like the red background against the peacock feather. Very nice.', '2005-05-31 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422605, 183261, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t know what it is, but I like this shot.  Normally I wouldn´t since this isn´t exactly an interesting place to visit but perhaps it´s the purple tone or the wide open space.  Also the infrared does a lot for this image.  8 from me.</td>', 'I don´t know what it is, but I like this shot.  Normally I wouldn´t since this isn´t exactly an interesting place to visit but perhaps it´s the purple tone or the wide open space.  Also the infrared does a lot for this image.  8 from me.', '2005-05-31 09:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422607, 183267, 15711, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE!!!!</td>', 'VERY NICE!!!!', '2005-05-31 09:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422608, 182782, 29154, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice photo, but I really hate the border (sorry but I has to tell)</td>', 'Extremely nice photo, but I really hate the border (sorry but I has to tell)', '2005-05-31 09:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422609, 182769, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo!</td>', 'Lovely photo!', '2005-05-31 09:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422610, 182550, 27482, '<td valign="top">If I give you a 10, will you promise to enter more of these kind of shots in challenges?  :o)</td>', 'If I give you a 10, will you promise to enter more of these kind of shots in challenges?  :o)', '2005-05-31 09:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422611, 182756, 29154, '<td valign="top">Nice capture ! Maybe try to saturate the greens a little bit; it would improve this beuatiful photo.</td>', 'Nice capture ! Maybe try to saturate the greens a little bit; it would improve this beuatiful photo.', '2005-05-31 09:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422612, 182772, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity.  Very nice.</td>', 'I like the simplicity.  Very nice.', '2005-05-31 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422614, 183085, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is lusciously eerie!! I like the ominous fog and gray tones. Very well done.</td>', 'Oh this is lusciously eerie!! I like the ominous fog and gray tones. Very well done.', '2005-05-31 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422616, 181311, 15711, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on a floral close up.  I like that you chose to make it "soft" instead of the usual crisp shot.  Well done. Very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'An interesting take on a floral close up.  I like that you chose to make it "soft" instead of the usual crisp shot.  Well done. Very pleasing to the eye.', '2005-05-31 09:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422618, 181725, 27482, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my own shot in "bokeh".  Anyway, love it, one of the few flower shots in the challenge that "do" something for me.  Especially love the sharpness and shallow DOF in it.  8 from me.</td>', 'Reminds me of my own shot in "bokeh".  Anyway, love it, one of the few flower shots in the challenge that "do" something for me.  Especially love the sharpness and shallow DOF in it.  8 from me.', '2005-05-31 09:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422620, 182726, 15711, '<td valign="top">Almost like perfect little beads.  Very nice.</td>', 'Almost like perfect little beads.  Very nice.', '2005-05-31 09:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422623, 183289, 15711, '<td valign="top">The bird on the wing makes this a perfect shot.  Lovely!!! Very well executed.</td>', 'The bird on the wing makes this a perfect shot.  Lovely!!! Very well executed.', '2005-05-31 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422626, 183214, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro. I like that it''s sepia!  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice macro. I like that it''s sepia!  Well done.', '2005-05-31 09:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422629, 183340, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not really fond of the coffee coloured sky but other than that very nice location you found there.</td>', 'I am not really fond of the coffee coloured sky but other than that very nice location you found there.', '2005-05-31 09:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422632, 183294, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this phto very much. It''s a different take on the subject matter. Nice angle and use of color.  (not to mention a great old truck!)</td>', 'I like this phto very much. It''s a different take on the subject matter. Nice angle and use of color.  (not to mention a great old truck!)', '2005-05-31 09:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422634, 183184, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2005-05-31 09:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422656, 183080, 318, '<td valign="top">Finally! Something interesting here.</td>', 'Finally! Something interesting here.', '2005-05-31 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422710, 183307, 38061, '<td valign="top">The colours and mood are PERfect</td>', 'The colours and mood are PERfect', '2005-05-31 10:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422715, 182616, 30018, '<td valign="top">pretty, but quite clichish.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'pretty, but quite clichish.  <5>', '2005-05-31 10:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422717, 182769, 35352, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is spectacular. I like the positioning of the sun and the colour of sky and water. The reeds distract a little down the bottom. The small waves give some interesting detail.</td>', 'Wow, this is spectacular. I like the positioning of the sun and the colour of sky and water. The reeds distract a little down the bottom. The small waves give some interesting detail.', '2005-05-31 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422719, 182252, 30018, '<td valign="top">Geee, it''s nice to learn as I score.  Never heard of "Rattlesnake Grass" before.  Very nice image.  I love the translucent leaves against the dark background.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Geee, it''s nice to learn as I score.  Never heard of "Rattlesnake Grass" before.  Very nice image.  I love the translucent leaves against the dark background.  <7>', '2005-05-31 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422721, 183031, 35352, '<td valign="top">All good things must come to an end - though hopefully not your photography. This is a really interesting photo - different to others in tehchallenge. I like the colour of the flower and how it contrasts with the green stem. Very nice. The pink is a little distracting.</td>', 'All good things must come to an end - though hopefully not your photography. This is a really interesting photo - different to others in tehchallenge. I like the colour of the flower and how it contrasts with the green stem. Very nice. The pink is a little distracting.', '2005-05-31 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422723, 182765, 30018, '<td valign="top">Not a great shot, with the flash direcly in front of the baby''s face.  This image looks very much like it was taken against a backdrop as well.  I''m guessing, this image will not do so well in this challenge due to the lack of technical work.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Not a great shot, with the flash direcly in front of the baby''s face.  This image looks very much like it was taken against a backdrop as well.  I''m guessing, this image will not do so well in this challenge due to the lack of technical work.  <5>', '2005-05-31 10:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422724, 183181, 35352, '<td valign="top">There is so much (implied) detail in that sky!! I would of loved to see this without the water. This is beautiful!</td>', 'There is so much (implied) detail in that sky!! I would of loved to see this without the water. This is beautiful!', '2005-05-31 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422726, 182772, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst the capture of light here is near-exemplary, I wonder whether it was necessary to submit a full frame shot - II''m not sure exactly what is added by not cropping the left and bottom edges - a stronger composition, strnger movement through frame of the main subject, stronger placement of horizon, and no loss of the beauty of that great light. Still a strong shot, mind; I just think it could have been very effectively improved - oh, and would love to see it like that, also.</td>', 'Whilst the capture of light here is near-exemplary, I wonder whether it was necessary to submit a full frame shot - II''m not sure exactly what is added by not cropping the left and bottom edges - a stronger composition, strnger movement through frame of the main subject, stronger placement of horizon, and no loss of the beauty of that great light. Still a strong shot, mind; I just think it could have been very effectively improved - oh, and would love to see it like that, also.', '2005-05-31 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422729, 183333, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is another great example of "Beauty is in the Eye of the Beholder", cus even though you and/or someone else finds this image beautiful, I''m really having a hard time finding the beauty in looking at someone''s feet and the belly of a pussycat.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'This is another great example of "Beauty is in the Eye of the Beholder", cus even though you and/or someone else finds this image beautiful, I''m really having a hard time finding the beauty in looking at someone''s feet and the belly of a pussycat.  <5>', '2005-05-31 10:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422735, 183210, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great detail, for the most part; I find the composition (and subject, really) a bit obvious, and I find the large amount of over-exposed space a shame -there is great detail in that eye, but I believe the whole thing could have been more effective if you had exposed for the white areas, and then brought the darker areas back, rather than letting the highlights go out like this.</td>', 'Great detail, for the most part; I find the composition (and subject, really) a bit obvious, and I find the large amount of over-exposed space a shame -there is great detail in that eye, but I believe the whole thing could have been more effective if you had exposed for the white areas, and then brought the darker areas back, rather than letting the highlights go out like this.', '2005-05-31 10:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422749, 182763, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, properly competent photography - I have no doubt this has become exactly what you wanted. Love the tonality, the bokeh, composition, etc. etc. I would wish only for something a little more thought-provoking than a butterfly on a flower, to make it ''beautiful'' rather than simply ''pretty'', if you like. But this must surely score well.</td>', 'Ah, properly competent photography - I have no doubt this has become exactly what you wanted. Love the tonality, the bokeh, composition, etc. etc. I would wish only for something a little more thought-provoking than a butterfly on a flower, to make it ''beautiful'' rather than simply ''pretty'', if you like. But this must surely score well.', '2005-05-31 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422751, 183197, 34192, '<td valign="top">Bumped to 10.  I find the implied movement captivating.</td>', 'Bumped to 10.  I find the implied movement captivating.', '2005-05-31 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422754, 182281, 34192, '<td valign="top">9. The simplicity and the lighting are what got me.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', '9. The simplicity and the lighting are what got me.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-31 10:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422757, 183323, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the POV, the composition, the B&amp;W. 10 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the POV, the composition, the B&W. 10 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-31 10:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422759, 183301, 6999, '<td valign="top">The sense of a warm evening is so strong here: beautifully captured and managed. I hope people give it the time it deserves, rather than dismissing it as a centred composition and therefore uninteresting by default. <i>I</i> like it very much indeed.</td>', 'The sense of a warm evening is so strong here: beautifully captured and managed. I hope people give it the time it deserves, rather than dismissing it as a centred composition and therefore uninteresting by default. I like it very much indeed.', '2005-05-31 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422762, 182770, 30018, '<td valign="top">Forgive for disagreeing, but I think these are the tools for hiding beauty.  However an interesting concept, and nicely arranged.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Forgive for disagreeing, but I think these are the tools for hiding beauty.  However an interesting concept, and nicely arranged.  <6>', '2005-05-31 10:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422763, 183228, 34192, '<td valign="top">Yes, you made me smile.  And for that I give you an 8.  Lighting not the best but the facial expressions make up for it.</td>', 'Yes, you made me smile.  And for that I give you an 8.  Lighting not the best but the facial expressions make up for it.', '2005-05-31 10:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422765, 182998, 3703, '<td valign="top">this is sooooooooooooooooo cute!!</td>', 'this is sooooooooooooooooo cute!!', '2005-05-31 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422775, 182726, 35161, '<td valign="top">Spider webs and water create wonderful jewels! Well captured! :)</td>', 'Spider webs and water create wonderful jewels! Well captured! :)', '2005-05-31 11:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422776, 183265, 327, '<td valign="top">Keep looking at this. Very attractive shot, the tones are very cool.</td>', 'Keep looking at this. Very attractive shot, the tones are very cool.', '2005-05-31 11:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422778, 182743, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2005-05-31 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422780, 183307, 327, '<td valign="top">Romantic, crisp, good shot.</td>', 'Romantic, crisp, good shot.', '2005-05-31 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422789, 182518, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The textured lines in the rocks really adds to the composition. Nice use of slow shutter speed in the water. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice! The textured lines in the rocks really adds to the composition. Nice use of slow shutter speed in the water. Well done.', '2005-05-31 11:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422797, 182843, 30959, '<td valign="top">Majestic indeed. These fellows are hard to capture in focus, the feathers tend to fool the eye. Well done.</td>', 'Majestic indeed. These fellows are hard to capture in focus, the feathers tend to fool the eye. Well done.', '2005-05-31 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422798, 182902, 30959, '<td valign="top">The silhouette makes the sunset, well caught.</td>', 'The silhouette makes the sunset, well caught.', '2005-05-31 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422799, 182984, 16829, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too garish. Also the subject doesn''t stand out. The eye is first drawn to all the busyness at center and center left which is uninteresting.</td>', 'Lighting is too garish. Also the subject doesn''t stand out. The eye is first drawn to all the busyness at center and center left which is uninteresting.', '2005-05-31 11:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422806, 182868, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good expression, interesting crop off of chin and top of head that is nicely balanced. Looks like there was excessive dodging on the right side which is distracting from your subject.</td>', 'Good expression, interesting crop off of chin and top of head that is nicely balanced. Looks like there was excessive dodging on the right side which is distracting from your subject.', '2005-05-31 11:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422816, 182550, 26437, '<td valign="top">um wow, super photo, even better subject :)</td>', 'um wow, super photo, even better subject :)', '2005-05-31 11:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422825, 183221, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling to this picture. I would like a deeper depth of field, but as is, it is still very appealing.</td>', 'Nice feeling to this picture. I would like a deeper depth of field, but as is, it is still very appealing.', '2005-05-31 11:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422826, 183085, 37334, '<td valign="top">eerie and beautiful 10</td>', 'eerie and beautiful 10', '2005-05-31 11:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422835, 183030, 37334, '<td valign="top">I love this image so much! It''s graphic and near perfect IMHO:)) 10</td>', 'I love this image so much! It''s graphic and near perfect IMHO:)) 10', '2005-05-31 11:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
