(1423067, 183283, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I see the water is in focus but because so much of the image is made of other strong elements their softness takes away from the presentation.  A shot like this is really difficult to acheive due to the slowness of the shutter.  The only thing I can think of is try a higher ISO and smaller aperature.  Course that is my opinion.  One of my favorite parts of the image is the water drips on the left.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I see the water is in focus but because so much of the image is made of other strong elements their softness takes away from the presentation.  A shot like this is really difficult to acheive due to the slowness of the shutter.  The only thing I can think of is try a higher ISO and smaller aperature.  Course that is my opinion.  One of my favorite parts of the image is the water drips on the left.  Beautiful!', '2005-05-31 13:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
