(1423168, 182616, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is BEAUTIFUL!   I love the composition, with the sun in the background.</td>', 'This is BEAUTIFUL!   I love the composition, with the sun in the background.', '2005-05-31 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423170, 182111, 24454, '<td valign="top">She''s very beautiful.    She looks like she''s in one of those carefree shakes of her head.  I like it a lot!</td>', 'She''s very beautiful.    She looks like she''s in one of those carefree shakes of her head.  I like it a lot!', '2005-05-31 13:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423174, 182785, 327, '<td valign="top">Thrilling shot to view. WOW. I really love the composition, it''s just perfect to my eye.</td>', 'Thrilling shot to view. WOW. I really love the composition, it''s just perfect to my eye.', '2005-05-31 13:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423177, 182599, 5822, '<td valign="top">A bit too flat for my tastess. Would prefer increased contrast and better focus.</td>', 'A bit too flat for my tastess. Would prefer increased contrast and better focus.', '2005-05-31 13:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423178, 182141, 35804, '<td valign="top">"(one of those places the camera cannot do justice)"...then why take the picture? Why not let the viewer look at this image without be steered by this really wierd "title"...Tranquil and Secluded would have been fine on their own, it certainly looks exactly that.</td>', '"(one of those places the camera cannot do justice)"...then why take the picture? Why not let the viewer look at this image without be steered by this really wierd "title"...Tranquil and Secluded would have been fine on their own, it certainly looks exactly that.', '2005-05-31 13:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423181, 183294, 327, '<td valign="top">I agree--------   beautiful! I''m a huge car/motorcycle buff, and never miss a rally if I can help it. This looks like a great get together. Love the color treatment here.</td>', 'I agree--------   beautiful! I''m a huge car/motorcycle buff, and never miss a rally if I can help it. This looks like a great get together. Love the color treatment here.', '2005-05-31 13:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423184, 183335, 327, '<td valign="top">Yummy colors. WOW. This is just...BEAUTIFUL&gt;</td>', 'Yummy colors. WOW. This is just...BEAUTIFUL>', '2005-05-31 13:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423188, 182950, 327, '<td valign="top">Intense eyes, wise beyond her years expression. Lovely girl, fantastic pink top. She''s really magnetic here.</td>', 'Intense eyes, wise beyond her years expression. Lovely girl, fantastic pink top. She''s really magnetic here.', '2005-05-31 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423190, 182918, 5822, '<td valign="top">Superb pet portrait. You''ve captured the animal''s character very well.  I think in this instance, the crop off the top of it''s head appears more haphazard than intention.  Still wonderful photo.</td>', 'Superb pet portrait. You''ve captured the animal''s character very well.  I think in this instance, the crop off the top of it''s head appears more haphazard than intention.  Still wonderful photo.', '2005-05-31 13:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423195, 183158, 14476, '<td valign="top">You take beauty where you can find it.  Nice one.</td>', 'You take beauty where you can find it.  Nice one.', '2005-05-31 13:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423201, 182281, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely interpretation of this plant</td>', 'Lovely interpretation of this plant', '2005-05-31 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423210, 182292, 5822, '<td valign="top">The white petals seem too gray.  Would have preferred softer lighting.</td>', 'The white petals seem too gray.  Would have preferred softer lighting.', '2005-05-31 14:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423217, 183085, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is really eerie and pretty looking!   I love the mist and the purple tones.   It''s very unique and striking.</td>', 'That is really eerie and pretty looking!   I love the mist and the purple tones.   It''s very unique and striking.', '2005-05-31 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423224, 182681, 24454, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  It draws you in.   I love the way it''s composed, and I love the black background..   Very neat picture.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  It draws you in.   I love the way it''s composed, and I love the black background..   Very neat picture.', '2005-05-31 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423226, 182105, 5792, '<td valign="top">The concept for this image is great. But a good backlight image is hard to pull off. In this case your sky is overexposed and you need more light on your angel''s face. A strong sidelight shinning down on your subject''s face and arms would give him a more angelic look as well as add much more interest to the composition. Under better lighting you would also need to clone out the angel wing straps. The general clarity of the image is not particularly good and would need to be improved.</td>', 'The concept for this image is great. But a good backlight image is hard to pull off. In this case your sky is overexposed and you need more light on your angel''s face. A strong sidelight shinning down on your subject''s face and arms would give him a more angelic look as well as add much more interest to the composition. Under better lighting you would also need to clone out the angel wing straps. The general clarity of the image is not particularly good and would need to be improved.', '2005-05-31 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423231, 183302, 24454, '<td valign="top">Gasp!!!    That is one of the most beautiful and striking portraits I''ve seen.   There''s not one thing that keeps this from being absolutely perfect.   She looks 3-dimensional like she is coming right out of the photo.   It seems like everyone would HAVE to give this a 10, so here is another one  :)</td>', 'Gasp!!!    That is one of the most beautiful and striking portraits I''ve seen.   There''s not one thing that keeps this from being absolutely perfect.   She looks 3-dimensional like she is coming right out of the photo.   It seems like everyone would HAVE to give this a 10, so here is another one  :)', '2005-05-31 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423236, 183213, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww.   That most definitely is beautiful.   I''ve often tried to capture a mom and her colt in a good photographable position, but it''s hard.   Usually you get the mom''s behind, or the colt''s behind.  This is just perfect!   I really love it.</td>', 'Awwww.   That most definitely is beautiful.   I''ve often tried to capture a mom and her colt in a good photographable position, but it''s hard.   Usually you get the mom''s behind, or the colt''s behind.  This is just perfect!   I really love it.', '2005-05-31 14:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423238, 182785, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!   This is SOOO beautiful!!!!   I''m so jealous of them getting to do that in those gorgeous mountains!    Excellent portrayal of beauty!!!!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!   This is SOOO beautiful!!!!   I''m so jealous of them getting to do that in those gorgeous mountains!    Excellent portrayal of beauty!!!!', '2005-05-31 14:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423239, 183321, 5822, '<td valign="top">The mist is really cool. Looks like this was taken in the early morning hours.  I don''t think the reflectioin adds much to the composition.</td>', 'The mist is really cool. Looks like this was taken in the early morning hours.  I don''t think the reflectioin adds much to the composition.', '2005-05-31 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423240, 182816, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from a common autofocus problem. You can see that the background is in clearer focus than your main subject. Autofocus, when left on its own, will tend to focus on the thing that takes up the most real estate in the frame like the background does here. You want to press your shutter half way down and turn your camera on what you want to focus on first then, when it is in focus, move the camera to compose the image before pushing the shutter the rest of the way down to complete taking the picture.<br/> <br/>Btw, nice cat!</td>', 'This image suffers from a common autofocus problem. You can see that the background is in clearer focus than your main subject. Autofocus, when left on its own, will tend to focus on the thing that takes up the most real estate in the frame like the background does here. You want to press your shutter half way down and turn your camera on what you want to focus on first then, when it is in focus, move the camera to compose the image before pushing the shutter the rest of the way down to complete taking the picture. Btw, nice cat!', '2005-05-31 14:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423241, 183335, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love those majenta tones, and the teeny little bird really adds to this photo.   It really is beautiful.</td>', 'I love those majenta tones, and the teeny little bird really adds to this photo.   It really is beautiful.', '2005-05-31 14:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423242, 183299, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is pretty.  It looks like a painting.</td>', 'This is pretty.  It looks like a painting.', '2005-05-31 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423248, 182751, 27482, '<td valign="top">Now this place I recognize :)<br/> <br/>Very good shot and love the tones and composition in it but I don´t really care for the sepia toning.  Good job.</td>', 'Now this place I recognize :) Very good shot and love the tones and composition in it but I don´t really care for the sepia toning.  Good job.', '2005-05-31 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423249, 183197, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You did an amazing job.   What would normally be a pretty ordinary subject has  been made beauriful by your depth of field, the lighting and the colors.   I really like this a lot.</td>', 'Wow!  You did an amazing job.   What would normally be a pretty ordinary subject has  been made beauriful by your depth of field, the lighting and the colors.   I really like this a lot.', '2005-05-31 14:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423250, 183338, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nicely done on the waterfall. I think I would have liked more of the foreground water included in the composition.  Also, I think this image would have benefited from a B&amp;W treatment. There is a yellow tinge to the photograph.</td>', 'Nicely done on the waterfall. I think I would have liked more of the foreground water included in the composition.  Also, I think this image would have benefited from a B&W treatment. There is a yellow tinge to the photograph.', '2005-05-31 14:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423256, 182843, 5822, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, despite a very common image.  Love those rich blues and greens. Terrific.</td>', 'Gorgeous, despite a very common image.  Love those rich blues and greens. Terrific.', '2005-05-31 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423268, 183289, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Wow!   I gasped when I first saw this.   It''s gorgeous.   It''s the kind of exotic, beautiful scene that makes people like me -- who live in scenery challenged places not want to even enter challenges like this --  but of course I did anyway and am kind of suffering for it too   :)    Everything about this is beautiful.   The light rays, the colors on the water, the lone bird flying in the light.   It''s just awesome.</td>', 'Oh Wow!   I gasped when I first saw this.   It''s gorgeous.   It''s the kind of exotic, beautiful scene that makes people like me -- who live in scenery challenged places not want to even enter challenges like this --  but of course I did anyway and am kind of suffering for it too   :)    Everything about this is beautiful.   The light rays, the colors on the water, the lone bird flying in the light.   It''s just awesome.', '2005-05-31 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423269, 181883, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes. . . .she is soooo beautiful!!!!</td>', 'Yes. . . .she is soooo beautiful!!!!', '2005-05-31 14:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423275, 183301, 30018, '<td valign="top">Who would have ever thought grass could look so "beautiful".  Very nicely done!  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Who would have ever thought grass could look so "beautiful".  Very nicely done!  <8>', '2005-05-31 14:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423277, 182902, 5822, '<td valign="top">Equisite silhouette and sunset. Color and composition are really good. Very well done.</td>', 'Equisite silhouette and sunset. Color and composition are really good. Very well done.', '2005-05-31 14:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423279, 183337, 4226, '<td valign="top">One of those images where framing adds to the beauty</td>', 'One of those images where framing adds to the beauty', '2005-05-31 14:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423286, 183066, 24454, '<td valign="top">You can''t know how heartsick looking at this makes me feel -- to be hiking in beautiful mountains like this!!!    That  truly IS paradise, and this is looks like a breathtaking place to hike.    I love your depth of field, and the beautiful colors of spring in those mountains.  10</td>', 'You can''t know how heartsick looking at this makes me feel -- to be hiking in beautiful mountains like this!!!    That  truly IS paradise, and this is looks like a breathtaking place to hike.    I love your depth of field, and the beautiful colors of spring in those mountains.  10', '2005-05-31 14:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423288, 182952, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but almost too much going on.  The little girl is a cutie, but her mother''s hair seems to draw the attention (because it is so different fromt he norm).  The bright green in the back ground, although OOF, is still so bright in too draws away from the foreground.  I like this image, but somehow find it somewhat annoying as my eye bounces around too much.  Although that probably doesn''t make too much sense, it''s the best way I can describe it. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Interesting image, but almost too much going on.  The little girl is a cutie, but her mother''s hair seems to draw the attention (because it is so different fromt he norm).  The bright green in the back ground, although OOF, is still so bright in too draws away from the foreground.  I like this image, but somehow find it somewhat annoying as my eye bounces around too much.  Although that probably doesn''t make too much sense, it''s the best way I can describe it. <7>', '2005-05-31 14:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423289, 183317, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a great capture!   It''s hard to get one in such an awesome photographable pose like that -- but two!   That is truly amazing.   I LOVE it!!!!</td>', 'What a great capture!   It''s hard to get one in such an awesome photographable pose like that -- but two!   That is truly amazing.   I LOVE it!!!!', '2005-05-31 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423294, 182177, 24454, '<td valign="top">And I just caught their yawn tooo  :)    Yes.  They are beautiful!!!!!</td>', 'And I just caught their yawn tooo  :)    Yes.  They are beautiful!!!!!', '2005-05-31 14:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423295, 183206, 24454, '<td valign="top">Anna is very beautiful.</td>', 'Anna is very beautiful.', '2005-05-31 14:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423298, 182959, 30018, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  This image absolutely captures the essense of the challenge.  Beautiful model, beautifully photographed.  I love the purple colors which almost seem to reflect off her face.  Nicely composed, with a great lighting technique.  The only flaw, and it is ever so tiny, is that I can see the photograper reflected in her eyes.  Otherwise, totally stunning and deserving of a ribbon.  Good luck.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'I love this image.  This image absolutely captures the essense of the challenge.  Beautiful model, beautifully photographed.  I love the purple colors which almost seem to reflect off her face.  Nicely composed, with a great lighting technique.  The only flaw, and it is ever so tiny, is that I can see the photograper reflected in her eyes.  Otherwise, totally stunning and deserving of a ribbon.  Good luck.  <9>', '2005-05-31 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423303, 183338, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes.  That is MY kind of beauty!   Waterfalls always grab my heart!   And this one really is especially beautiful.    I love your slow shutter speed on the water.   The only thing that  could make this better would be  if I could actually be there looking at it myself!  :)</td>', 'Yes.  That is MY kind of beauty!   Waterfalls always grab my heart!   And this one really is especially beautiful.    I love your slow shutter speed on the water.   The only thing that  could make this better would be  if I could actually be there looking at it myself!  :)', '2005-05-31 14:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423307, 183223, 30018, '<td valign="top">Beauty can be defined and described in many different ways.  This is the only image that even approaches this soft peaceful, tranquil feeling many of us hope to experience in our own time.  This is magnificently photographed and should do very, very well.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Beauty can be defined and described in many different ways.  This is the only image that even approaches this soft peaceful, tranquil feeling many of us hope to experience in our own time.  This is magnificently photographed and should do very, very well.  <9>', '2005-05-31 14:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423308, 183212, 30018, '<td valign="top">There are many other flowers in this challenge, but this one gets my highest score amongst the flowers.  Very nice job blurring the perimeter and forcing the eye to focus on the center of the image where the water droplets reside.  Smooth, soothing and enjoyable to view.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'There are many other flowers in this challenge, but this one gets my highest score amongst the flowers.  Very nice job blurring the perimeter and forcing the eye to focus on the center of the image where the water droplets reside.  Smooth, soothing and enjoyable to view.  <8>', '2005-05-31 14:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423311, 182357, 30018, '<td valign="top">Great capture, one I have yet to be able to do successfully.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Great capture, one I have yet to be able to do successfully.  <7>', '2005-05-31 14:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423314, 182918, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of "pet pictures" but this is very nicely done.  Maybe a little grooming (brushing of his ears) would have made for a more beautiful image &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of "pet pictures" but this is very nicely done.  Maybe a little grooming (brushing of his ears) would have made for a more beautiful image <7>', '2005-05-31 14:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423315, 183066, 5792, '<td valign="top">Scenes like this highlight the incredible pastoral beauty that nature has to offer. The composition is inviting and engaging.</td>', 'Scenes like this highlight the incredible pastoral beauty that nature has to offer. The composition is inviting and engaging.', '2005-05-31 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423318, 183334, 30018, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image.  Very nice range of tones.  I also love the translucentcy of the image with the blown out back ground.  Wonderful job of back lighting.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Outstanding image.  Very nice range of tones.  I also love the translucentcy of the image with the blown out back ground.  Wonderful job of back lighting.  <8>', '2005-05-31 14:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423321, 181883, 30018, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of my grand-daughter.  Very nice capture of a beautiful little girlie-girl.  Nice composition, with the blown out background makes this a fun image to veiw.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Reminds me so much of my grand-daughter.  Very nice capture of a beautiful little girlie-girl.  Nice composition, with the blown out background makes this a fun image to veiw.  <8>', '2005-05-31 14:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423326, 182776, 30018, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  The one image of a beautiful girl who isn''t half naked, and trying to earn votes in that manner.  I love this image.  It''s free-caring, and easy going.  Not formal, yet very beautiful.  Thank you for not going for the underwear look with this beautiful model.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Stunning.  The one image of a beautiful girl who isn''t half naked, and trying to earn votes in that manner.  I love this image.  It''s free-caring, and easy going.  Not formal, yet very beautiful.  Thank you for not going for the underwear look with this beautiful model.  <9>', '2005-05-31 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423329, 183222, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This would have been very strong in the silhouette challenge.  &lt;7&gt;  Pushin'' this one up a notch  &lt;8&gt;  Bumping this one up one last notch.  I really enjoy looking at this image, and it deserves the extra credit.  Very nice job!   &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Very nice.  This would have been very strong in the silhouette challenge.  <7>  Pushin'' this one up a notch  <8>  Bumping this one up one last notch.  I really enjoy looking at this image, and it deserves the extra credit.  Very nice job!   <9>', '2005-05-31 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423330, 182892, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes.  I think these infrared photos are so beautiful!   I''d love to get a filter and be able to take pictures like ths.</td>', 'Yes.  I think these infrared photos are so beautiful!   I''d love to get a filter and be able to take pictures like ths.', '2005-05-31 14:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423335, 181992, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this for it''s simplicity</td>', 'I like this for it''s simplicity', '2005-05-31 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423338, 183072, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh wow!   That is gorgeous!!    I love the way the clouds partially cover the sun.  It makes it more interesting.</td>', 'Oh wow!   That is gorgeous!!    I love the way the clouds partially cover the sun.  It makes it more interesting.', '2005-05-31 14:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423341, 183320, 30018, '<td valign="top">Beauty is in the eye of the beholder, and in this image, although I am seeing a fine looking young man, I''m not seeing a fine looking image.  The fuzziness around his body doesn''t look good at all, and the sky occupies way too much of this image.  &lt;3&gt;</td>', 'Beauty is in the eye of the beholder, and in this image, although I am seeing a fine looking young man, I''m not seeing a fine looking image.  The fuzziness around his body doesn''t look good at all, and the sky occupies way too much of this image.  <3>', '2005-05-31 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423344, 183151, 24454, '<td valign="top">How sweet!    What timing!    I love this.</td>', 'How sweet!    What timing!    I love this.', '2005-05-31 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423346, 183242, 30018, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.  Poor lighting.  Lack of interest.  Not sure this is fitting into the challenge description, although very broad.  I''m sorry, this just doesn''t do it for me at all.  &lt;3&gt;</td>', 'Out of focus.  Poor lighting.  Lack of interest.  Not sure this is fitting into the challenge description, although very broad.  I''m sorry, this just doesn''t do it for me at all.  <3>', '2005-05-31 14:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
