(1423522, 183210, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! What strikes me first about this is the clarity of detail and light in the eye, the vivid colour of the beak and the contrast between white and black. Composition is OK but feels a little chopped off. It doesn''t convey the grace that even a bird like a gull possesses. Also, I do think it''s a shame that much of the feather detail is blown out since the areas where it''s captured are so much more interested visually.</td>', 'Wow! What strikes me first about this is the clarity of detail and light in the eye, the vivid colour of the beak and the contrast between white and black. Composition is OK but feels a little chopped off. It doesn''t convey the grace that even a bird like a gull possesses. Also, I do think it''s a shame that much of the feather detail is blown out since the areas where it''s captured are so much more interested visually.', '2005-05-31 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
