(1423543, 181561, 14986, '<td valign="top">Technically a nice shot....good exposure and sharpness.    Certainly a nice looking dog, but IMO  there''s really nothing special or exciting about the photo.   The lighting seems nice and even, but somewhat flat...no nice highlights or interest.  I would also prefer the dog''s head to be more in the right of the frame - a little less centered.   He / she really looks like a nice companion, though, and I think it''s a good fit for the challenge.  Hopefully the "no pets no kids" crowd won''t knock you too hard!</td>', 'Technically a nice shot....good exposure and sharpness.    Certainly a nice looking dog, but IMO  there''s really nothing special or exciting about the photo.   The lighting seems nice and even, but somewhat flat...no nice highlights or interest.  I would also prefer the dog''s head to be more in the right of the frame - a little less centered.   He / she really looks like a nice companion, though, and I think it''s a good fit for the challenge.  Hopefully the "no pets no kids" crowd won''t knock you too hard!', '2005-05-31 16:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423545, 182988, 25232, '<td valign="top">The frame will cost you. Work on the composition.</td>', 'The frame will cost you. Work on the composition.', '2005-05-31 16:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423548, 181725, 14986, '<td valign="top">Great color!  For composition, I would prefer the center of the rose positioned more in the center of the frame - it seems crowded right above it.  Other than that, a very nice shot that maybe isn''t so original, but very pretty.</td>', 'Great color!  For composition, I would prefer the center of the rose positioned more in the center of the frame - it seems crowded right above it.  Other than that, a very nice shot that maybe isn''t so original, but very pretty.', '2005-05-31 16:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423552, 182892, 25232, '<td valign="top">Sky is too dark toward the top center, but otherwise a great image.</td>', 'Sky is too dark toward the top center, but otherwise a great image.', '2005-05-31 16:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
