(1423599, 182183, 14986, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty sky and setting, but nothing really out of the ordinary.  Skies are one of my favorite things, so I do like it.  Trees look kind of fuzzy, out of focus.   Composition isn''t too bad, with the sun on the one side and higher trees balancing the other side.  I would probably crop some of the darkness off of the bottom to focus the viewer more on the sky.   Thanks for sharing a pretty sunset!</td>', 'It''s a pretty sky and setting, but nothing really out of the ordinary.  Skies are one of my favorite things, so I do like it.  Trees look kind of fuzzy, out of focus.   Composition isn''t too bad, with the sun on the one side and higher trees balancing the other side.  I would probably crop some of the darkness off of the bottom to focus the viewer more on the sky.   Thanks for sharing a pretty sunset!', '2005-05-31 16:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423604, 182648, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Gorgeous.  I like his casual stance and the way he is placed in the composition.</td>', 'Wow.  Gorgeous.  I like his casual stance and the way he is placed in the composition.', '2005-05-31 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423605, 183197, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely.  The colors and composition work together for a very graceful and elegant looking photo.  I would like just a bit more light on the left side of the feather, but that''s nit picking.   Definitely a creative way to bring out the beauty in this subject.</td>', 'This is really lovely.  The colors and composition work together for a very graceful and elegant looking photo.  I would like just a bit more light on the left side of the feather, but that''s nit picking.   Definitely a creative way to bring out the beauty in this subject.', '2005-05-31 16:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423607, 182174, 37103, '<td valign="top">I have never seen a cloud like that.  It is truly magnificent.  I like that you kept the emphasis of this photo on the cloud.  You coul probably even have cropped out more of the grass for a more dramatic effect.</td>', 'I have never seen a cloud like that.  It is truly magnificent.  I like that you kept the emphasis of this photo on the cloud.  You coul probably even have cropped out more of the grass for a more dramatic effect.', '2005-05-31 16:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423611, 183154, 14986, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot of the flowers.  A little more noise than I would like to see.  Certainly meets the challenge, but not in a particularly creative or out of the ordinary way.</td>', 'Pretty shot of the flowers.  A little more noise than I would like to see.  Certainly meets the challenge, but not in a particularly creative or out of the ordinary way.', '2005-05-31 16:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423612, 181290, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very soft light, gentle colors - gives you a feel for the beauty of the person.  That feeling contrasts dramatically with the composition - the abrupt croping of the face.  I am conflicted between thinking it enhances the softness by comparison or is too jarring for the softness of the subject.  Technically the  lighting and focus and detail are lovely.  <br/></td>', 'Very soft light, gentle colors - gives you a feel for the beauty of the person.  That feeling contrasts dramatically with the composition - the abrupt croping of the face.  I am conflicted between thinking it enhances the softness by comparison or is too jarring for the softness of the subject.  Technically the  lighting and focus and detail are lovely.  ', '2005-05-31 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423614, 182987, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love the pinpoint of light in the center of the iris.  Very clear beautiful image.</td>', 'I love the pinpoint of light in the center of the iris.  Very clear beautiful image.', '2005-05-31 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423616, 183151, 37103, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot of something we rarely see.  Beautiful lighting on the bird.</td>', 'Amazing shot of something we rarely see.  Beautiful lighting on the bird.', '2005-05-31 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423620, 183228, 37103, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  They have the same expression on their face.  I would have maybe cropped out the camera.</td>', 'Adorable.  They have the same expression on their face.  I would have maybe cropped out the camera.', '2005-05-31 16:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423621, 183033, 14986, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the left is a distraction for me, but I''m not sure how I would light it differently.  I like that you thought to do something a little more creative than just a straight on shot of the bloom.    I feel like something is missing....some more color maybe?  A different background?  I''m not sure.  Technically a good shot, but it doesn''t wow me.</td>', 'The shadow on the left is a distraction for me, but I''m not sure how I would light it differently.  I like that you thought to do something a little more creative than just a straight on shot of the bloom.    I feel like something is missing....some more color maybe?  A different background?  I''m not sure.  Technically a good shot, but it doesn''t wow me.', '2005-05-31 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423622, 182174, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous sky.  I like the drama of the range of light.  I wish the foreground were compelling enough to balance the sky or simple enough to not distract from it.  Here the wires and scattered small buildings just draw the eye away and they are nothing to look at on their own.  Perhaps finding one lone building and compose it to one side or the other would work?</td>', 'What a fabulous sky.  I like the drama of the range of light.  I wish the foreground were compelling enough to balance the sky or simple enough to not distract from it.  Here the wires and scattered small buildings just draw the eye away and they are nothing to look at on their own.  Perhaps finding one lone building and compose it to one side or the other would work?', '2005-05-31 16:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423628, 183227, 14986, '<td valign="top">Gotta agree that a sunset over the water is indeed beautiful.   Nice shot of it, but not a particularly creative or unique shot for the highest score.</td>', 'Gotta agree that a sunset over the water is indeed beautiful.   Nice shot of it, but not a particularly creative or unique shot for the highest score.', '2005-05-31 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423631, 182915, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.  Like the treatment of the water.  Crop okay, composition good.   My eyes are fuzzy right now so I will not comment on sharpness.  Well done. 7 may bump later.</td>', 'Beautiful bird.  Like the treatment of the water.  Crop okay, composition good.   My eyes are fuzzy right now so I will not comment on sharpness.  Well done. 7 may bump later.', '2005-05-31 16:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423633, 182965, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  I would like to see the brightness toned down just a bit and maybe bring out a little richness in the colors, but it''s also nice just as it is.  For composition, I think it would have been better with just a bit less of the left side and including the full wing - however I know it''s just hard enough to get a butterfly - much less getting that perfect composition before it flies away!</td>', 'This is really nice.  I would like to see the brightness toned down just a bit and maybe bring out a little richness in the colors, but it''s also nice just as it is.  For composition, I think it would have been better with just a bit less of the left side and including the full wing - however I know it''s just hard enough to get a butterfly - much less getting that perfect composition before it flies away!', '2005-05-31 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423635, 182639, 24137, '<td valign="top">Simply breathtaking!</td>', 'Simply breathtaking!', '2005-05-31 16:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423636, 182188, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop motion capture.  Good composition.  Honestly, the wall detracts but I cannot fault you for that - we take our images where we find them.  Detail, colors, crop excellent. 8.  May bump later.</td>', 'Excellent stop motion capture.  Good composition.  Honestly, the wall detracts but I cannot fault you for that - we take our images where we find them.  Detail, colors, crop excellent. 8.  May bump later.', '2005-05-31 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423637, 182751, 24137, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m crazy, but at the top it looks like a horse is coming out of the water, with it''s mane flowing back. Very cool capture.</td>', 'Maybe I''m crazy, but at the top it looks like a horse is coming out of the water, with it''s mane flowing back. Very cool capture.', '2005-05-31 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423646, 182111, 34192, '<td valign="top">softness, noise, blah, blah blah.  You''ve probably heard it all.  The lighting is excellent in this image - really adds to the composition.  Really like this image. Also don''t mind the softness or noise.  It gives the image a mood that can''t be replicated with neatimage and USM.  The capture of movement in this image is excellent.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'softness, noise, blah, blah blah.  You''ve probably heard it all.  The lighting is excellent in this image - really adds to the composition.  Really like this image. Also don''t mind the softness or noise.  It gives the image a mood that can''t be replicated with neatimage and USM.  The capture of movement in this image is excellent.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-31 16:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423648, 182357, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent stop motion capture.  Good composition and crop.  Good POV, DOF, colors.  Very well done. 8, may bump later.</td>', 'excellent stop motion capture.  Good composition and crop.  Good POV, DOF, colors.  Very well done. 8, may bump later.', '2005-05-31 16:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
