(1423672, 183342, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,   This is a cool place in a great location.  Certainly fits the challenge.  I would have liked something of a more unique composition for this, rather than just straight on, centered in the frame.   The colors seem somewhat muted as well.   <br/></td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,   This is a cool place in a great location.  Certainly fits the challenge.  I would have liked something of a more unique composition for this, rather than just straight on, centered in the frame.   The colors seem somewhat muted as well.   ', '2005-05-31 17:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423678, 183242, 34814, '<td valign="top">Focus is off</td>', 'Focus is off', '2005-05-31 17:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423679, 182281, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,  this isn''t too bad.   The really light part of the stem draws the eye and is not the best part of the shot.    Actually, that whole right section of the plant really doesn''t add anything from my perspective to the photo.  I would have liked less on the right and left and a tighter crop on the leaves which do have interesting lines and texture and lighting.  <br/></td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,  this isn''t too bad.   The really light part of the stem draws the eye and is not the best part of the shot.    Actually, that whole right section of the plant really doesn''t add anything from my perspective to the photo.  I would have liked less on the right and left and a tighter crop on the leaves which do have interesting lines and texture and lighting.  ', '2005-05-31 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423683, 182997, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,   this is really pretty.  I like the yellow and peach tones.  I think what I like best is the curves and diagonal lines of the flower''s center. Great dof and focus.  I like this one alot.<br/></td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,   this is really pretty.  I like the yellow and peach tones.  I think what I like best is the curves and diagonal lines of the flower''s center. Great dof and focus.  I like this one alot.', '2005-05-31 17:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
