(1423730, 183067, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done and love the crop. I''d love to see this in vibrant, highly saturated color though. This shot seems to cry out for vivid greens against a softly blurred background. Having chosen the BW though, you''ve achieved a beautiful tonal range and very pleasing depth. Nice job!</td>', 'Very nicely done and love the crop. I''d love to see this in vibrant, highly saturated color though. This shot seems to cry out for vivid greens against a softly blurred background. Having chosen the BW though, you''ve achieved a beautiful tonal range and very pleasing depth. Nice job!', '2005-05-31 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423734, 181438, 19978, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I like the presentation and crop. Chopping the forehead and leaving shoulders prominent feels "right" to me. Something feels off to me though, maybe the shadows around the eyes and mouth? Not sure. Nice intense and serious portrait. Not sure I get your intention though with the title. Good job.</td>', 'Hmmm, I like the presentation and crop. Chopping the forehead and leaving shoulders prominent feels "right" to me. Something feels off to me though, maybe the shadows around the eyes and mouth? Not sure. Nice intense and serious portrait. Not sure I get your intention though with the title. Good job.', '2005-05-31 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
