(1423789, 181752, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual shot! Beautiful and distinctive colour palette, a composition that really stands out from the norm and fantastic detail on the butterfly with perfect, perfect background. A straight 10!</td>', 'What an unusual shot! Beautiful and distinctive colour palette, a composition that really stands out from the norm and fantastic detail on the butterfly with perfect, perfect background. A straight 10!', '2005-05-31 18:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
