(1423795, 182357, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Having spent a couple of hours trying to capture some of these critters (using a hand held zoom with a fairly slow maximum aperture) I totally appreciate the crispness and composition of yours! The only negative for me is the quality/ colour of the light - it seems very flat and doesn''t make the bird "sing" to me.</td>', 'Great capture! Having spent a couple of hours trying to capture some of these critters (using a hand held zoom with a fairly slow maximum aperture) I totally appreciate the crispness and composition of yours! The only negative for me is the quality/ colour of the light - it seems very flat and doesn''t make the bird "sing" to me.', '2005-05-31 18:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423798, 182681, 3087, '<td valign="top">An unusual interpretation. I like how you have chosen to share a beautiful emotion being felt by an artist conveying beautiful music to a no-doubt appreciative audience. Nice lighting and excellent composition too.</td>', 'An unusual interpretation. I like how you have chosen to share a beautiful emotion being felt by an artist conveying beautiful music to a no-doubt appreciative audience. Nice lighting and excellent composition too.', '2005-05-31 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
