(1423871, 182765, 7628, '<td valign="top">A charming child - such warm eyes!  While the flash and narrow depth of focus serve to make the face stand out from the background, the drastic difference in the quality, color and direction of the light in the foreground and background clash in a way I find distracting.  Using natural light (it looks like bright day) or a flash that isn''t so close to your subject would be better.</td>', 'A charming child - such warm eyes!  While the flash and narrow depth of focus serve to make the face stand out from the background, the drastic difference in the quality, color and direction of the light in the foreground and background clash in a way I find distracting.  Using natural light (it looks like bright day) or a flash that isn''t so close to your subject would be better.', '2005-05-31 18:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
