(1424682, 182986, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,  I don''t get a whole lot from this photo.  I like the sheer fabrics, but I can''t really tell what''s happening here.  I think part of the drawback for me is that there is a lot going on in the background.  It seems to distract from the major elements of the front woman and the material.   I haven''t seen the color version, but these tones don''t seem to add interest to the shot for me.  I do like the unique subject and the flow of the material, but it just doesn''t make me think "beautiful."</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,  I don''t get a whole lot from this photo.  I like the sheer fabrics, but I can''t really tell what''s happening here.  I think part of the drawback for me is that there is a lot going on in the background.  It seems to distract from the major elements of the front woman and the material.   I haven''t seen the color version, but these tones don''t seem to add interest to the shot for me.  I do like the unique subject and the flow of the material, but it just doesn''t make me think "beautiful."', '2005-06-01 00:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1424683, 182918, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. What a face!! Good entry hope you do well. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. What a face!! Good entry hope you do well. Nice lighting.', '2005-06-01 00:51:27.000000', NULL, 1);
