(1426426, 182543, 29894, '<td valign="top">I''m a Toys "R" Us kid!</td>', 'I''m a Toys "R" Us kid!', '2005-06-01 14:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426460, 183294, 32576, '<td valign="top">Nice with the monochromatics</td>', 'Nice with the monochromatics', '2005-06-01 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426461, 183322, 32430, '<td valign="top">OK, my first child was born Saturday so maybe I''m biased, but this is great.  The potential and love held in the face make this a winner.</td>', 'OK, my first child was born Saturday so maybe I''m biased, but this is great.  The potential and love held in the face make this a winner.', '2005-06-01 15:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426462, 183339, 29894, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the relationship between you and the man in the picture but I think that it would be better if he wasn''t in there. maybe a different angle where the broken trunk in the front is gone too...not bad though! :)</td>', 'I don''t know the relationship between you and the man in the picture but I think that it would be better if he wasn''t in there. maybe a different angle where the broken trunk in the front is gone too...not bad though! :)', '2005-06-01 15:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426470, 181883, 29894, '<td valign="top">maybe bring the focus back on the eyes a little?</td>', 'maybe bring the focus back on the eyes a little?', '2005-06-01 15:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426481, 182770, 29894, '<td valign="top">looks over sharpened</td>', 'looks over sharpened', '2005-06-01 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426488, 181386, 29894, '<td valign="top">maybe crop a little bit of the sky out...around the top of the trees</td>', 'maybe crop a little bit of the sky out...around the top of the trees', '2005-06-01 15:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426489, 182892, 29894, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2005-06-01 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426490, 183289, 32236, '<td valign="top">This is a really pretty image and quite moody. I may be missing something here, but I can''t quite make out what the blur is on the left center? I can see that it would have been difficult to crop out because then the highlight of the water wouldn''t have been bounded on both sides by dark and would have spoiled the compositional balance. <br/> <br/>I love how the seagull is flying into the light beam.</td>', 'This is a really pretty image and quite moody. I may be missing something here, but I can''t quite make out what the blur is on the left center? I can see that it would have been difficult to crop out because then the highlight of the water wouldn''t have been bounded on both sides by dark and would have spoiled the compositional balance.  I love how the seagull is flying into the light beam.', '2005-06-01 15:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426494, 182153, 29894, '<td valign="top">awesome shot! looks like you start to lose focus on the head and tail but its still a great capture</td>', 'awesome shot! looks like you start to lose focus on the head and tail but its still a great capture', '2005-06-01 15:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426501, 182550, 29894, '<td valign="top">hot! not a big fan of what looks like the spot from a little tanning sticker maybe? love the eyes though</td>', 'hot! not a big fan of what looks like the spot from a little tanning sticker maybe? love the eyes though', '2005-06-01 15:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426502, 183319, 32236, '<td valign="top">He is such a handsome little devil! :)</td>', 'He is such a handsome little devil! :)', '2005-06-01 15:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426508, 183181, 29894, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it with some of the water cropped out at the bottom, focusing more on the sky, its reflection, and the trees</td>', 'I''d like to see it with some of the water cropped out at the bottom, focusing more on the sky, its reflection, and the trees', '2005-06-01 15:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426517, 182782, 11895, '<td valign="top">the frame/border is ... ah, ....  a major negative to this entry.  It overwhelming and makes a nice shot look like tacky digital art.</td>', 'the frame/border is ... ah, ....  a major negative to this entry.  It overwhelming and makes a nice shot look like tacky digital art.', '2005-06-01 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426518, 183294, 29894, '<td valign="top">the truck is sweet! maybe desat all but the truck, i think selective desat would work well here. also I think a different angle or even closer up would look good.</td>', 'the truck is sweet! maybe desat all but the truck, i think selective desat would work well here. also I think a different angle or even closer up would look good.', '2005-06-01 15:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426522, 183205, 29894, '<td valign="top">great portrait!</td>', 'great portrait!', '2005-06-01 15:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426531, 183192, 32236, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear her sing!</td>', 'I can almost hear her sing!', '2005-06-01 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426535, 182693, 32236, '<td valign="top">Nice blue/orange sunset hues.</td>', 'Nice blue/orange sunset hues.', '2005-06-01 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426536, 182177, 29894, '<td valign="top">this cracks me up! :) great pic</td>', 'this cracks me up! :) great pic', '2005-06-01 15:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426538, 183085, 29894, '<td valign="top">definately one of my favorites out of this challenge!</td>', 'definately one of my favorites out of this challenge!', '2005-06-01 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426541, 183305, 29894, '<td valign="top">not sure if it was intentional or not but I don''t think I like the soft focus here.</td>', 'not sure if it was intentional or not but I don''t think I like the soft focus here.', '2005-06-01 15:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426549, 183115, 30625, '<td valign="top">Composition: 10 Excellent with horizonline level and just below center<br/>Technical: 10 Colors just look so natural.<br/>Challenge: 10 The beauty of a sunset is just amazing.<br/>Creativity: 10 I like how you made it into a wide angle more pleasing.<br/>Overall: 10 Very well done.</td>', 'Composition: 10 Excellent with horizonline level and just below centerTechnical: 10 Colors just look so natural.Challenge: 10 The beauty of a sunset is just amazing.Creativity: 10 I like how you made it into a wide angle more pleasing.Overall: 10 Very well done.', '2005-06-01 15:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426552, 183228, 32236, '<td valign="top">It looks to me as though this critter was paying attention when you said "Say cheese!". But someone forgot to hand him the comb... Good capture!</td>', 'It looks to me as though this critter was paying attention when you said "Say cheese!". But someone forgot to hand him the comb... Good capture!', '2005-06-01 15:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426557, 183008, 30625, '<td valign="top">Compostion: 6 Filled the frame a little to tight. I think more of her hair would have been nice. I also this its centered to much maybe a little more to the right or the left would have enhanced the image a little more.<br/>Technical: 6 I dont know if you were going for a soft look but shot like this sharp would have been the way I would have gone.<br/>Creativity: 5 Just to basic of a shot.<br/>Challenge: 10 She is beautiful.<br/>Overall: 6</td>', 'Compostion: 6 Filled the frame a little to tight. I think more of her hair would have been nice. I also this its centered to much maybe a little more to the right or the left would have enhanced the image a little more.Technical: 6 I dont know if you were going for a soft look but shot like this sharp would have been the way I would have gone.Creativity: 5 Just to basic of a shot.Challenge: 10 She is beautiful.Overall: 6', '2005-06-01 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426562, 183161, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 very beautiful location.<br/>Compostion: 7 The waterfall is too centered a little to the left or right would have given more green giving a more vibrant color. This would have also removed some of the lens blur in the right corner of the stream. <br/>Technical: 8 I can''t tell if this is a snap shot or a timed shot. The stream is telling me snap shot but the falls is showing me a timed shot due to the movment of water.<br/>Creativity: 10 Waterfalls are just so appealing to photography. <br/>Overall:9<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 10 very beautiful location.Compostion: 7 The waterfall is too centered a little to the left or right would have given more green giving a more vibrant color. This would have also removed some of the lens blur in the right corner of the stream. Technical: 8 I can''t tell if this is a snap shot or a timed shot. The stream is telling me snap shot but the falls is showing me a timed shot due to the movment of water.Creativity: 10 Waterfalls are just so appealing to photography. Overall:9', '2005-06-01 15:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426566, 182986, 29797, '<td valign="top">Gorgeuous photo, but there''s an eerieness with that girl on the right, almost like a ghost caught in a photo.</td>', 'Gorgeuous photo, but there''s an eerieness with that girl on the right, almost like a ghost caught in a photo.', '2005-06-01 16:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426573, 183004, 7628, '<td valign="top">The septer is a nice touch - makes this photo stand out from other portraits.  Wish we could see either more or less of her dress, the bit peeking into the frame draws your eyes away from her face.</td>', 'The septer is a nice touch - makes this photo stand out from other portraits.  Wish we could see either more or less of her dress, the bit peeking into the frame draws your eyes away from her face.', '2005-06-01 16:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426575, 182761, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lovely sky.  I like the sliver of horizon it "grounds" the picture.  Colors are a bit purple for my taste - feels a bit unnatural.</td>', 'A lovely sky.  I like the sliver of horizon it "grounds" the picture.  Colors are a bit purple for my taste - feels a bit unnatural.', '2005-06-01 16:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426578, 183184, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great foreground catching the reflection of the light - but what are they?? Could be sharper.</td>', 'Great foreground catching the reflection of the light - but what are they?? Could be sharper.', '2005-06-01 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426581, 182219, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of textures and colors.  Wish the rocks and greenery were in sharp focus.  I like the 1/3 compisition line.</td>', 'Nice contrast of textures and colors.  Wish the rocks and greenery were in sharp focus.  I like the 1/3 compisition line.', '2005-06-01 16:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426584, 182649, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great shot!    Very well done.</td>', 'Great shot!    Very well done.', '2005-06-01 16:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426587, 182188, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is VERY beautiful.   Great focus for a stop action.   I just love this!</td>', 'This is VERY beautiful.   Great focus for a stop action.   I just love this!', '2005-06-01 16:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426593, 181936, 29797, '<td valign="top">REALLY nice shot. Maybe a bit too much dodging or exposure or something  (I can''t tell) on the waterfall. Composition, everything else superb! Nice shot.</td>', 'REALLY nice shot. Maybe a bit too much dodging or exposure or something  (I can''t tell) on the waterfall. Composition, everything else superb! Nice shot.', '2005-06-01 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426594, 183032, 7628, '<td valign="top">The droplets of water look great against the black feathers.  I like how the beak comes down to the right hand corner.  I would crop at the top.  Narrow DOF works well too. Wish the lighting or the composition were more compelling - while the picture is nice it just doesnt catch my eye.</td>', 'The droplets of water look great against the black feathers.  I like how the beak comes down to the right hand corner.  I would crop at the top.  Narrow DOF works well too. Wish the lighting or the composition were more compelling - while the picture is nice it just doesnt catch my eye.', '2005-06-01 16:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426603, 183080, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary.  The sea of flowers is the perfect backgroun/foreground - the woman stands out well against it, but at the same time the whole effect is very soft and lovely. 9</td>', 'This is extraordinary.  The sea of flowers is the perfect backgroun/foreground - the woman stands out well against it, but at the same time the whole effect is very soft and lovely. 9', '2005-06-01 16:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426614, 182639, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  Perhaps a bit too melodramatic - all that high contrast but with no central subject feels like a bit of a contradiction - I suppose your intent is "what we do not see but can imagine."</td>', 'Very dramatic.  Perhaps a bit too melodramatic - all that high contrast but with no central subject feels like a bit of a contradiction - I suppose your intent is "what we do not see but can imagine."', '2005-06-01 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426633, 182925, 7628, '<td valign="top">This bird looks like it is made of velvet!  I like how the beak is really the only color everything else is soft browns and blacks.  Wish the reflection wasn''t cropped at the bottom - perhaps cropping it out entirely and cropping in from the left hand side would create a more unusual comosition?  Lovely to look at nonetheless!</td>', 'This bird looks like it is made of velvet!  I like how the beak is really the only color everything else is soft browns and blacks.  Wish the reflection wasn''t cropped at the bottom - perhaps cropping it out entirely and cropping in from the left hand side would create a more unusual comosition?  Lovely to look at nonetheless!', '2005-06-01 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426638, 182550, 7628, '<td valign="top">the hot pink background is perfect for this seductive shot.  I think you''re going right past beauty and colliding with lust.</td>', 'the hot pink background is perfect for this seductive shot.  I think you''re going right past beauty and colliding with lust.', '2005-06-01 16:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426641, 182211, 25678, '<td valign="top">I''ll drink to this beauty!<br/>Nice shot</td>', 'I''ll drink to this beauty!Nice shot', '2005-06-01 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426644, 182693, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,  this is a cool shot.   You ahve picked the perfect time of day to bring out the beauty of the scene.  I''m not sure about the tree.  I can''t decide if it really adds anything to the photo.  I think maybe I would like it better without the tree if there would be a different place that would work for that.  However, even with the tree this is very nice.  I wish the colors were just a bit richer in tone.  I like the curves and shadows a lot.   Good job.</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,  this is a cool shot.   You ahve picked the perfect time of day to bring out the beauty of the scene.  I''m not sure about the tree.  I can''t decide if it really adds anything to the photo.  I think maybe I would like it better without the tree if there would be a different place that would work for that.  However, even with the tree this is very nice.  I wish the colors were just a bit richer in tone.  I like the curves and shadows a lot.   Good job.', '2005-06-01 16:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426646, 182770, 7628, '<td valign="top">An unusal idea - stand out amoung the flowers and pretty women and kids.  I like the composition and the glaring lights.  Feels like its not quite sharp and then a bit over sharpened in processing.  Very classy nonetheless.</td>', 'An unusal idea - stand out amoung the flowers and pretty women and kids.  I like the composition and the glaring lights.  Feels like its not quite sharp and then a bit over sharpened in processing.  Very classy nonetheless.', '2005-06-01 16:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426650, 182311, 7628, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more of an obvious subject, point of interest.  It is a nice sky and lovely colors, a bit out of focus.  Wish the silouette''s of the trees were sharper/clearer to give contrast to the bilowing clouds.</td>', 'I wish there were more of an obvious subject, point of interest.  It is a nice sky and lovely colors, a bit out of focus.  Wish the silouette''s of the trees were sharper/clearer to give contrast to the bilowing clouds.', '2005-06-01 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426657, 182662, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the narrow DOF - the background is a lovely impressionistic frame to the flower.  Wish the flower itself had more distinction - a bit out of focus, and the lighting makes all the petals blend - a bit more contrast or more contrast light would have helped bringout all the subtle details in the petals.</td>', 'I like the narrow DOF - the background is a lovely impressionistic frame to the flower.  Wish the flower itself had more distinction - a bit out of focus, and the lighting makes all the petals blend - a bit more contrast or more contrast light would have helped bringout all the subtle details in the petals.', '2005-06-01 16:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426658, 183189, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,  you picked a beautifu spot for the photo.  Technically it''s a well done shot, I think.  Although, I think it would look better with the foreground rocks darkened some and if the cloud whites weren''t blown out quite as much.   Still a very pretty setting, and nice composition.  It does make me think "beauty."   It doesn''t, however, make me go "wow".  Not a unique or creative take on the challenge, but a nice photo anyway.  Oh...and I really like borders, but I think this one overpowers the scene a bit.</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,  you picked a beautifu spot for the photo.  Technically it''s a well done shot, I think.  Although, I think it would look better with the foreground rocks darkened some and if the cloud whites weren''t blown out quite as much.   Still a very pretty setting, and nice composition.  It does make me think "beauty."   It doesn''t, however, make me go "wow".  Not a unique or creative take on the challenge, but a nice photo anyway.  Oh...and I really like borders, but I think this one overpowers the scene a bit.', '2005-06-01 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426660, 182543, 30959, '<td valign="top">This is so rich. Any kid would love to have this on thier wall. Outstanding catch. Nice bokeh, dof and composition.</td>', 'This is so rich. Any kid would love to have this on thier wall. Outstanding catch. Nice bokeh, dof and composition.', '2005-06-01 16:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426670, 183242, 30959, '<td valign="top">This photo is fairly busy and the composition does not compliment the subject very well. Its lack of focus will hurt it in the voting. I am drawn to the eyes and would like to see them sharper and much closer. Hope this helps.</td>', 'This photo is fairly busy and the composition does not compliment the subject very well. Its lack of focus will hurt it in the voting. I am drawn to the eyes and would like to see them sharper and much closer. Hope this helps.', '2005-06-01 16:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426673, 181255, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said, certainly a child meets the challenge for beauty.  I personally don''t like the selective desat here.  Why empahsize the flower and earring?   I beleive the soft focus was intentional, but I would have liked more clarity on the eyes.  I also don''t care for the mouth position and overall expression.  It''s a cute girl and I like the b/w but those elements bring the otherwise nice portrait down a few notches for me.</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said, certainly a child meets the challenge for beauty.  I personally don''t like the selective desat here.  Why empahsize the flower and earring?   I beleive the soft focus was intentional, but I would have liked more clarity on the eyes.  I also don''t care for the mouth position and overall expression.  It''s a cute girl and I like the b/w but those elements bring the otherwise nice portrait down a few notches for me.', '2005-06-01 16:35:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1426678, 181438, 30959, '<td valign="top">A compelling photo which drives a hard point, however beauty is not readily apparent here. The eyes are a bit to deep into shadow and his coloration is a bit sallow.</td>', 'A compelling photo which drives a hard point, however beauty is not readily apparent here. The eyes are a bit to deep into shadow and his coloration is a bit sallow.', '2005-06-01 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426694, 183223, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,   I''ve looked at this a few times trying to decide if I like the processing or not.   I think I do.  I''m sure others will argue that opinion.  You''ve taken a relatively basic scene and created a nice "mood".    I don''t really care that much for the tone or the border.  I do like the "glow" effect here.  I think your title adds to this particular shot as well.</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,   I''ve looked at this a few times trying to decide if I like the processing or not.   I think I do.  I''m sure others will argue that opinion.  You''ve taken a relatively basic scene and created a nice "mood".    I don''t really care that much for the tone or the border.  I do like the "glow" effect here.  I think your title adds to this particular shot as well.', '2005-06-01 16:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426720, 183178, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said, this is an interesting plant I''ve not seen before.  Colors are great, but I don''t like the composition or dof all that much.  Having the out of focus selections so prominent, and having the focused one partly covered - just doesn''t add anything to the shot imo.  I  think the biggest drawback to my eye, is the large one in front on the left that really seems to take over and it makes the composition very unbalanced in my view.</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said, this is an interesting plant I''ve not seen before.  Colors are great, but I don''t like the composition or dof all that much.  Having the out of focus selections so prominent, and having the focused one partly covered - just doesn''t add anything to the shot imo.  I  think the biggest drawback to my eye, is the large one in front on the left that really seems to take over and it makes the composition very unbalanced in my view.', '2005-06-01 16:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426739, 182546, 7628, '<td valign="top">The bright light in this picture makes it seem over exposed - everything is a bit washed out.  Wish your subject (rock? lava?) was not cropped at the bottom.</td>', 'The bright light in this picture makes it seem over exposed - everything is a bit washed out.  Wish your subject (rock? lava?) was not cropped at the bottom.', '2005-06-01 16:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426749, 182892, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow!   That is beautiful! I like your thoughtful composition - the diagnal curve of the line on trees complimented by the curve of the hill and the triangle of grass - the little touch of civilization on the left - almost a checkerboard of clouds and sky too. 8</td>', 'Wow!   That is beautiful! I like your thoughtful composition - the diagnal curve of the line on trees complimented by the curve of the hill and the triangle of grass - the little touch of civilization on the left - almost a checkerboard of clouds and sky too. 8', '2005-06-01 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426763, 182988, 811, '<td valign="top">That is too awesome.  If you offer it as a print, please, please, let me know.  My little sister LOVES these animals and I would like to get her one!!!  <br/> <br/>Great colors and composition.</td>', 'That is too awesome.  If you offer it as a print, please, please, let me know.  My little sister LOVES these animals and I would like to get her one!!!   Great colors and composition.', '2005-06-01 16:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426788, 183205, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured beauty.  You''re a lucky man/woman (LOL)!  She''s beautiful, but more than that you managed to capture a playful emotion and used the lighting and focus to augment that feeling.  My only other comment would be that I think you could turn up the color &amp; contrast a bit more.  Don''t get me wrong - Very nice job!  (7)...  I changed my mind.  (8)  ;-)</td>', 'Wonderfully captured beauty.  You''re a lucky man/woman (LOL)!  She''s beautiful, but more than that you managed to capture a playful emotion and used the lighting and focus to augment that feeling.  My only other comment would be that I think you could turn up the color & contrast a bit more.  Don''t get me wrong - Very nice job!  (7)...  I changed my mind.  (8)  ;-)', '2005-06-01 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
