(1426905, 183021, 35513, '<td valign="top">I truly enjoy this photo :-)  I love the contrast in colors, and the DOF on the ant is amazing!!  There''s so much detail and clarity.  It really is a beautiful shot of something most people take for granted.  Excellent job and one of my favs for this challenge!</td>', 'I truly enjoy this photo :-)  I love the contrast in colors, and the DOF on the ant is amazing!!  There''s so much detail and clarity.  It really is a beautiful shot of something most people take for granted.  Excellent job and one of my favs for this challenge!', '2005-06-01 17:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426908, 183085, 35513, '<td valign="top">Serene and mysterious at the same time.  I emjoy this shot quite a bit.  I love the look of the water and the darker muted colors.  Beautiful job.</td>', 'Serene and mysterious at the same time.  I emjoy this shot quite a bit.  I love the look of the water and the darker muted colors.  Beautiful job.', '2005-06-01 17:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426910, 183214, 35513, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks for this challenge!  The clarity and detail is superb.  Good composition and fantastic lighting.  I like that you chose to leave the color off, it allows us to focus on the structure of the plant.</td>', 'One of my top picks for this challenge!  The clarity and detail is superb.  Good composition and fantastic lighting.  I like that you chose to leave the color off, it allows us to focus on the structure of the plant.', '2005-06-01 17:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
