(1426915, 182959, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!!  What amazing eyes on this model.  I like that the photo is also simplistic, letting the beauty of the model speak for itself.  Nice lighting, good job with the focus on the eyes.  It really draws attention.</td>', 'I really like this photo!!  What amazing eyes on this model.  I like that the photo is also simplistic, letting the beauty of the model speak for itself.  Nice lighting, good job with the focus on the eyes.  It really draws attention.', '2005-06-01 17:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426918, 183087, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very cute!!  Good clarity and detail.  I''m not sure, but it may be neat to experiment with different ways of cropping this image.  The heads of the horses are almost perfectly centered.  Beautiful colors in this shot!  And what an adorable moment to capture :-) 9</td>', 'Very cute!!  Good clarity and detail.  I''m not sure, but it may be neat to experiment with different ways of cropping this image.  The heads of the horses are almost perfectly centered.  Beautiful colors in this shot!  And what an adorable moment to capture :-) 9', '2005-06-01 17:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426920, 183192, 35513, '<td valign="top">Superb capture!!  The clarity on the bird is stunning!  Lighting is beautiful, composition is beautiful.  Can''t find a single thing wrong :-)  Straight to the top!</td>', 'Superb capture!!  The clarity on the bird is stunning!  Lighting is beautiful, composition is beautiful.  Can''t find a single thing wrong :-)  Straight to the top!', '2005-06-01 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
