(1426923, 183289, 35513, '<td valign="top">The different textures between the water and the sky are outstanding in this shot.  Wonderful sillhouette of the bird as well.  The light coming through the clouds really ties the photo together, as well as the bit of dark orange in the upper left.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The different textures between the water and the sky are outstanding in this shot.  Wonderful sillhouette of the bird as well.  The light coming through the clouds really ties the photo together, as well as the bit of dark orange in the upper left.  Nicely done!', '2005-06-01 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1426926, 183319, 35513, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity and detail!!  Good composition and beautiful colors.  The left antennae is slightly out of focus, but that''s the only thing anyone could possibly find to gripe about!  DOF is very well done indeed.</td>', 'Amazing clarity and detail!!  Good composition and beautiful colors.  The left antennae is slightly out of focus, but that''s the only thing anyone could possibly find to gripe about!  DOF is very well done indeed.', '2005-06-01 17:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
