(1426929, 182763, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good color and clarity!!  I think it would be stunning with an even slightly closer shot of the butterfly.  But I''m very glad you left some green at the top as it offsets the flower and insect very well.  Good composition.</td>', 'Good color and clarity!!  I think it would be stunning with an even slightly closer shot of the butterfly.  But I''m very glad you left some green at the top as it offsets the flower and insect very well.  Good composition.', '2005-06-01 17:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
