(1427845, 182716, 35645, '<td valign="top">The pose on this one looks a little forced - the left arm looks to be hanging a wee bit unnatually. More of a bend would have helped, perhaps with her hand on the fron of her hip or across her belly.  The lighting on this is absolutely without a doubt gorgeous, and I love that she appears to be ''doing'' instead of just ''posing''.</td>', 'The pose on this one looks a little forced - the left arm looks to be hanging a wee bit unnatually. More of a bend would have helped, perhaps with her hand on the fron of her hip or across her belly.  The lighting on this is absolutely without a doubt gorgeous, and I love that she appears to be ''doing'' instead of just ''posing''.', '2005-06-01 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
