(1427991, 183304, 19982, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  And especially like that you used side lighting.  I think just a tad more light on the front of the subject would have helped give the plant some more life.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  And especially like that you used side lighting.  I think just a tad more light on the front of the subject would have helped give the plant some more life.', '2005-06-02 00:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1427997, 183047, 19982, '<td valign="top">I always struggle with this in my own images and think you''ve fallen into the same trap I do.  The image as presented here looks a tad oversharpened.  I''m still trying to perfect my own sharpening technique (especially when it comes to downsizing as that it has such a huge impact on the image), I simply recommend playing around a bit looking for what works.  Beyond that ... I really love the colors you''ve captured here!  Simply amazing!  Makes me wish I were there.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I always struggle with this in my own images and think you''ve fallen into the same trap I do.  The image as presented here looks a tad oversharpened.  I''m still trying to perfect my own sharpening technique (especially when it comes to downsizing as that it has such a huge impact on the image), I simply recommend playing around a bit looking for what works.  Beyond that ... I really love the colors you''ve captured here!  Simply amazing!  Makes me wish I were there.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-02 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1427999, 183137, 19982, '<td valign="top">I would probably greatly lower the saturation on this... the harsh green in the background is destracting me from looking at the foreground.</td>', 'I would probably greatly lower the saturation on this... the harsh green in the background is destracting me from looking at the foreground.', '2005-06-02 00:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428010, 183049, 6668, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for this bright red background, it is a bit overpowering in my opinion, takes away from the adorable kitten.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for this bright red background, it is a bit overpowering in my opinion, takes away from the adorable kitten.', '2005-06-02 00:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428021, 183069, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The addition of the bird completes an already beautiful landscape.  I think I would have prefered the bird along the left third... but that is such a minor nit.  Excellent colors.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened in the cliffs.  I sometimes use the history brush and paint back the unsharpened image over top of areas I don''t want sharpened (or if I don''t want sharpened as much, I use a low opacity).  Anyway, nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice.  The addition of the bird completes an already beautiful landscape.  I think I would have prefered the bird along the left third... but that is such a minor nit.  Excellent colors.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened in the cliffs.  I sometimes use the history brush and paint back the unsharpened image over top of areas I don''t want sharpened (or if I don''t want sharpened as much, I use a low opacity).  Anyway, nicely done!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-02 00:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428027, 182111, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, though image seems to have alot of noise the distracts from the quality of the image in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice capture, though image seems to have alot of noise the distracts from the quality of the image in my opinion.', '2005-06-02 01:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
