(1428081, 182261, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.)<br/> <br/>That being said,  I like the creativity shown here.  In this instance, I also think the selective desat works.  In looking at this photo, my first thought is not "beauty", however.  It''s clever and the technical aspects are okay, but the idea doesn''t really strike a chord with me in regards to beauty.  Still a fairly high score based on the photo''s merits.</td>', 'Beauty is a subjective thing, I know.  In my scoring and comments I''m trying to score based on NOT whether or not I would think a particular subject beautiful, but on whether the photographer has succeeded in creating a beautiful photo.  I look for the elements of color, lines, focus and dof interest, lighting,  and a certain element of grace and lovlieness.   I''m looking for a unique and creative  appeal for the highest scorers.  The description says to create a photo that makes the viewer think "that''s beautiful", so it will undoubtedly be very subjective.   (This is what I''m putting at the start of all of my comments,  and I hope it is helpful.) That being said,  I like the creativity shown here.  In this instance, I also think the selective desat works.  In looking at this photo, my first thought is not "beauty", however.  It''s clever and the technical aspects are okay, but the idea doesn''t really strike a chord with me in regards to beauty.  Still a fairly high score based on the photo''s merits.', '2005-06-02 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
