(1428531, 182550, 36141, '<td valign="top">Find it hard to say why I dislike this photo. Maybe it''s because I can''t find any beauty in piercings, maybe it''s the way she looks, maybe it''s just it being an erotic photograph, but the expression on her face doesn''t match the body language, don''t know, maybe it''s all of that together. 3</td>', 'Find it hard to say why I dislike this photo. Maybe it''s because I can''t find any beauty in piercings, maybe it''s the way she looks, maybe it''s just it being an erotic photograph, but the expression on her face doesn''t match the body language, don''t know, maybe it''s all of that together. 3', '2005-06-02 04:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428534, 183270, 36141, '<td valign="top">Can''t really make out what you''re trying to say in this photo. It doesn''t strike me as something beautiful. To me this photo speaks of despair, drugs, totally lost in....? 3.</td>', 'Can''t really make out what you''re trying to say in this photo. It doesn''t strike me as something beautiful. To me this photo speaks of despair, drugs, totally lost in....? 3.', '2005-06-02 04:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
