(1428693, 183205, 27605, '<td valign="top">Yep, you''re one lucky fellow!  She''s lovely.  But even more than that, I score this strongly on the emotional appeal.  It just feels genuine.  (8)</td>', 'Yep, you''re one lucky fellow!  She''s lovely.  But even more than that, I score this strongly on the emotional appeal.  It just feels genuine.  (8)', '2005-06-02 08:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
