(1428700, 182855, 27605, '<td valign="top">Those little ear tufts look almost lynx-like.  Well lit, although I think a greater dof could improve the shot even more.  Still I do like it.  (7)</td>', 'Those little ear tufts look almost lynx-like.  Well lit, although I think a greater dof could improve the shot even more.  Still I do like it.  (7)', '2005-06-02 09:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428702, 182983, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice!   Shame about that brown oof plant at left, oh well.  I even like the border but think it would be better if only 1 or 2 pixels wide, just a sharp little yellow line.  (Just my opinion, no deduction of course).  (7)</td>', 'Very nice!   Shame about that brown oof plant at left, oh well.  I even like the border but think it would be better if only 1 or 2 pixels wide, just a sharp little yellow line.  (Just my opinion, no deduction of course).  (7)', '2005-06-02 09:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428708, 181752, 27605, '<td valign="top">Beauty in the ordinary, just a little moth.  His perch on the grass stalk, just right...  like the color gradation from yellow in the center to yellow/reds at the edges... think the frame is just perfect.  My only cause for pause is the tallest center grass blade, not much you could do but it''s presence *slightly* diminishes the shot I feel.  (9)</td>', 'Beauty in the ordinary, just a little moth.  His perch on the grass stalk, just right...  like the color gradation from yellow in the center to yellow/reds at the edges... think the frame is just perfect.  My only cause for pause is the tallest center grass blade, not much you could do but it''s presence *slightly* diminishes the shot I feel.  (9)', '2005-06-02 09:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
