(1428874, 182543, 327, '<td valign="top">Such a face. You must of been up on something tall as he/she was. Neat shot. The ear on the right makes this all the funnier!! Cute shot. I think this is beauty, or it is to me. I''d like to see you adjust levels some and maybe burn the face to make this pop! Kool animal.</td>', 'Such a face. You must of been up on something tall as he/she was. Neat shot. The ear on the right makes this all the funnier!! Cute shot. I think this is beauty, or it is to me. I''d like to see you adjust levels some and maybe burn the face to make this pop! Kool animal.', '2005-06-02 11:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428878, 183206, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice fun photo, I like the white on white.</td>', 'Nice fun photo, I like the white on white.', '2005-06-02 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
