(1429382, 182950, 27605, '<td valign="top">I can''t pinpoint just exactly why I like this photo so much, but it''s probably her eyes.  I get the impression that she''s a very strong individual, even for one so young.  By the way,  I personally would much rather see portraits without the cropped top of the head... just me but I thought I''d mention it.  (8)  Beautiful!</td>', 'I can''t pinpoint just exactly why I like this photo so much, but it''s probably her eyes.  I get the impression that she''s a very strong individual, even for one so young.  By the way,  I personally would much rather see portraits without the cropped top of the head... just me but I thought I''d mention it.  (8)  Beautiful!', '2005-06-02 15:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429405, 183342, 32117, '<td valign="top">beautiful gurudwara!<br/>it wud have looked better had this hillock in the foreground would have be at a lower altitude so that the full frontal facade of the building wud have got a better view!<br/>anyweays best of luck</td>', 'beautiful gurudwara!it wud have looked better had this hillock in the foreground would have be at a lower altitude so that the full frontal facade of the building wud have got a better view!anyweays best of luck', '2005-06-02 15:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429422, 183206, 32117, '<td valign="top">great pic!<br/>a perfect 10 to u!</td>', 'great pic!a perfect 10 to u!', '2005-06-02 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
