(1430539, 182986, 38264, '<td valign="top">Very different...</td>', 'Very different...', '2005-06-03 00:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430606, 183305, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like shots like this, but this one needs some work, imo. First, it appears to be OOF. Also, I think you could have cropped out the tree in the lower right hand corner, which would also eliminate the blown out, detail-less sky.</td>', 'I like shots like this, but this one needs some work, imo. First, it appears to be OOF. Also, I think you could have cropped out the tree in the lower right hand corner, which would also eliminate the blown out, detail-less sky.', '2005-06-03 01:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430624, 183214, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the grain, but find your choice of sepia toning a questionable as there is a lack of contrasts that help to diferentiate the various parts of the petals.</td>', 'I like the grain, but find your choice of sepia toning a questionable as there is a lack of contrasts that help to diferentiate the various parts of the petals.', '2005-06-03 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430630, 183283, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, but appears out of focus</td>', 'Interesting abstract, but appears out of focus', '2005-06-03 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430638, 183021, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus on the ant needs to be a lot better.  I do, however, like the colors and blurred background.</td>', 'Focus on the ant needs to be a lot better.  I do, however, like the colors and blurred background.', '2005-06-03 01:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430648, 183031, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the textures and colors you''ve captured here, but think the focus needs to be deeper</td>', 'Love the textures and colors you''ve captured here, but think the focus needs to be deeper', '2005-06-03 01:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430652, 182952, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice tender moment you''ve captured.  Skin tones are excellent, but this image has an almost comical side to it.  That is, the contrasts between girl''s soft hair and the spikes of the mohawk. I especially like the way the heads line up. I think you could have cropped out a great deal on the left side and bottom.</td>', 'Nice tender moment you''ve captured.  Skin tones are excellent, but this image has an almost comical side to it.  That is, the contrasts between girl''s soft hair and the spikes of the mohawk. I especially like the way the heads line up. I think you could have cropped out a great deal on the left side and bottom.', '2005-06-03 01:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430664, 183176, 34888, '<td valign="top">Awesome... 10</td>', 'Awesome... 10', '2005-06-03 02:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430665, 181883, 34888, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait</td>', 'Excellent portrait', '2005-06-03 02:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430685, 183114, 16241, '<td valign="top">oh cute, inspired by the hair challenge! :)</td>', 'oh cute, inspired by the hair challenge! :)', '2005-06-03 02:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430688, 181357, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant shot!  Looks crisp, clear, and refreshing :-)</td>', 'Lovely vibrant shot!  Looks crisp, clear, and refreshing :-)', '2005-06-03 02:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430692, 183209, 35513, '<td valign="top">Just flowers indeed!!!  Bah!  A beautiful rendition of these flowers in my opinion.  I love the colors and I love the blurred background.  Very nicely done photo :-)</td>', 'Just flowers indeed!!!  Bah!  A beautiful rendition of these flowers in my opinion.  I love the colors and I love the blurred background.  Very nicely done photo :-)', '2005-06-03 02:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430693, 183295, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really love the colors and composition of this shot!  Not normally a fan of the all white background, but it really works well here.  Good job!</td>', 'Really love the colors and composition of this shot!  Not normally a fan of the all white background, but it really works well here.  Good job!', '2005-06-03 02:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430694, 181961, 35513, '<td valign="top">The colors in this image seem a little soft to me...they lack a little bit of vibrance that would really make this photo shine!  I like the composition, and I like the creativity of this shot.  Definitely not something I saw other attempts of this challenge :-)</td>', 'The colors in this image seem a little soft to me...they lack a little bit of vibrance that would really make this photo shine!  I like the composition, and I like the creativity of this shot.  Definitely not something I saw other attempts of this challenge :-)', '2005-06-03 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430701, 183082, 35513, '<td valign="top">A lovely eye, and a crisp image.  I feel like the whites/lights are a little too white/light.  Even the darker colors of the eyelashes seem very light, which isn''t bad except that we have little contrast to help draw our eye into this photo.</td>', 'A lovely eye, and a crisp image.  I feel like the whites/lights are a little too white/light.  Even the darker colors of the eyelashes seem very light, which isn''t bad except that we have little contrast to help draw our eye into this photo.', '2005-06-03 02:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430702, 183223, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image quite a bit.  I would be curious to see it in color, because I think that would really lend a nice mood to this photo.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image quite a bit.  I would be curious to see it in color, because I think that would really lend a nice mood to this photo.', '2005-06-03 02:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430705, 182253, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and nice composition.  I think I would enjoy a tighter crop of the main subject as well.  Plenty of plants that are lovely, but there''s something to be said about the beauty of someone working a job they enjoy.</td>', 'Nice colors and nice composition.  I think I would enjoy a tighter crop of the main subject as well.  Plenty of plants that are lovely, but there''s something to be said about the beauty of someone working a job they enjoy.', '2005-06-03 02:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430707, 183242, 35513, '<td valign="top">What a lovely kitty!!!  The focus on the cat seems slightly soft to me.  I think that a crisper image would really make this shot pop more.</td>', 'What a lovely kitty!!!  The focus on the cat seems slightly soft to me.  I think that a crisper image would really make this shot pop more.', '2005-06-03 02:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430711, 182105, 35513, '<td valign="top">Go ahead and make the image as large as the site will let you!!  It lets us see more detail when we''re voting :-)  I like the composition of this image quite a bit.  The lighting is almost either too bright or not enough.  The subject looks pretty dark (dark enough to obscure detail) but not so dark as to really make a sillhouette.  Really like the creativity :-)</td>', 'Go ahead and make the image as large as the site will let you!!  It lets us see more detail when we''re voting :-)  I like the composition of this image quite a bit.  The lighting is almost either too bright or not enough.  The subject looks pretty dark (dark enough to obscure detail) but not so dark as to really make a sillhouette.  Really like the creativity :-)', '2005-06-03 02:26:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1430712, 183333, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good crisp clear image!!  I have to say I find the feet a bit distracting...but what a cute cat!!  Lighting looks good on this shot and the colors look good too.</td>', 'Good crisp clear image!!  I have to say I find the feet a bit distracting...but what a cute cat!!  Lighting looks good on this shot and the colors look good too.', '2005-06-03 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430715, 181883, 35513, '<td valign="top">What an adorable little girl!! :-)  Very cute picture.  I like the blur behind her, but I would be interested in seeing this in color.  Her eyes are very expressive and I think they might come out better in color.  Good composition as well!</td>', 'What an adorable little girl!! :-)  Very cute picture.  I like the blur behind her, but I would be interested in seeing this in color.  Her eyes are very expressive and I think they might come out better in color.  Good composition as well!', '2005-06-03 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430718, 182141, 35513, '<td valign="top">It does look tranquil :-)  Good composition and an interesting shot.  Don''t know what you have for editing software, but if you''re in PhotoShop, try playing with the Levels and the Color Balance.  Maybe adjusting some things in there will make you feel  like the picture pops more.  I kinda like it the way it is though :-)</td>', 'It does look tranquil :-)  Good composition and an interesting shot.  Don''t know what you have for editing software, but if you''re in PhotoShop, try playing with the Levels and the Color Balance.  Maybe adjusting some things in there will make you feel  like the picture pops more.  I kinda like it the way it is though :-)', '2005-06-03 02:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430722, 182111, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the subject of this shot!  Lighting looks pretty good too, but there is quite a bit of noise/grain in this image.  Check out the demo of NeatImage, which should help clear that right up!  Other than that, I really like this pic a lot :-)</td>', 'Love the composition and the subject of this shot!  Lighting looks pretty good too, but there is quite a bit of noise/grain in this image.  Check out the demo of NeatImage, which should help clear that right up!  Other than that, I really like this pic a lot :-)', '2005-06-03 02:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430724, 183335, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this photo!  And the sillhouettes of the birds really make it for me :-)  Bumping up!!</td>', 'I love the colors in this photo!  And the sillhouettes of the birds really make it for me :-)  Bumping up!!', '2005-06-03 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
