(1430727, 182769, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot and the waves in the water.  I like that instead of it being your typical sunset pic where 2/3 of the pic is sky, you have a lot of water.  Gives it a nice different feel.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot and the waves in the water.  I like that instead of it being your typical sunset pic where 2/3 of the pic is sky, you have a lot of water.  Gives it a nice different feel.', '2005-06-03 02:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
