(1431007, 183294, 19978, '<td valign="top">Was this taken during the challenge dates or in the 1950''s?? Seriously, love the use of selective desat. I like the little bits of the background that also retained their color. Beautiful truck and an image that surely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Was this taken during the challenge dates or in the 1950''s?? Seriously, love the use of selective desat. I like the little bits of the background that also retained their color. Beautiful truck and an image that surely meets the challenge.', '2005-06-03 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431013, 182902, 19978, '<td valign="top">Definitely not a boring sunset image. I love the silhouetted buildings and the tones in the sky, but the sun''s rays washing over the mountain in the background are just breathtaking. Kudos to you for capturing this image and your post-processing, if any, is superb. The only thing "wrong" with this image is some may bump you down because it''s "just" a sunset. What it is, is an example of why sunset shots can be so effective, and can work so well. Congrats on a great entry and a great accomplishment.</td>', 'Definitely not a boring sunset image. I love the silhouetted buildings and the tones in the sky, but the sun''s rays washing over the mountain in the background are just breathtaking. Kudos to you for capturing this image and your post-processing, if any, is superb. The only thing "wrong" with this image is some may bump you down because it''s "just" a sunset. What it is, is an example of why sunset shots can be so effective, and can work so well. Congrats on a great entry and a great accomplishment.', '2005-06-03 10:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431027, 182443, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. I would have loved to see it larger though, using the full size allocation you are given. The colors are vibrant and lighting perfect. Great accomplishment!</td>', 'Simply beautiful. I would have loved to see it larger though, using the full size allocation you are given. The colors are vibrant and lighting perfect. Great accomplishment!', '2005-06-03 10:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431029, 182953, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea, but the fact that the window light is so blown out is too bad. That''s a very tough exposure to capture correctly, but there are ways with some post processing hocus-pocus. Nice entry.</td>', 'Very interesting idea, but the fact that the window light is so blown out is too bad. That''s a very tough exposure to capture correctly, but there are ways with some post processing hocus-pocus. Nice entry.', '2005-06-03 10:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
