(1431114, 183323, 38006, '<td valign="top">The reason I like this photo is because it tells a story somewhere. It''s easier to take a shot of still life or something but to take a shot where there may be a story is a little tougher. I just wish the bike was an older bike! ;) great use of b/w to add drama.</td>', 'The reason I like this photo is because it tells a story somewhere. It''s easier to take a shot of still life or something but to take a shot where there may be a story is a little tougher. I just wish the bike was an older bike! ;) great use of b/w to add drama.', '2005-06-03 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
