(1431129, 182575, 38006, '<td valign="top">Overall I feel like the composition is good. I feel however that the use of the burn and dodge tool might be over used here. If I''m wrong, killer shot. But I dont think that I am. Some lighting feels awkward in a natural sense. In an artistic sense it could work though.</td>', 'Overall I feel like the composition is good. I feel however that the use of the burn and dodge tool might be over used here. If I''m wrong, killer shot. But I dont think that I am. Some lighting feels awkward in a natural sense. In an artistic sense it could work though.', '2005-06-03 10:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431134, 183272, 38006, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. This photo is telling a story and that is important to me. The ONLY thing I would have tried to change is the direction in which her dress was blowing. I would have tried to get the entire dress to blow to the side rather than have the air shoot into the dress...make sense? Good shot!</td>', 'I like this shot. This photo is telling a story and that is important to me. The ONLY thing I would have tried to change is the direction in which her dress was blowing. I would have tried to get the entire dress to blow to the side rather than have the air shoot into the dress...make sense? Good shot!', '2005-06-03 11:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431138, 183303, 38006, '<td valign="top">Again, not a big flower photo guy but this is a GREAT shot. so clear and perfect. The water on the rose is so refreshing looking and really makes the flower feel healthy and fresh...Just like this photo. Love it.</td>', 'Again, not a big flower photo guy but this is a GREAT shot. so clear and perfect. The water on the rose is so refreshing looking and really makes the flower feel healthy and fresh...Just like this photo. Love it.', '2005-06-03 11:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
