(1431406, 183294, 19746, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat, really brings out that deep cherry red colour.  I would have tried to go with a shallowed DOF on this one if I were you.  The red is a little distracting.  G''luck with this shiny red monster ;)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Nice selective desat, really brings out that deep cherry red colour.  I would have tried to go with a shallowed DOF on this one if I were you.  The red is a little distracting.  G''luck with this shiny red monster ;) Alex', '2005-06-03 13:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431410, 181662, 19746, '<td valign="top">That IS beautiful!  Would be nice if the reeds were on the left hand side instead of on the right as they break up the reflection, but there isn''t too much you can do about that!  Lovely capture :)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'That IS beautiful!  Would be nice if the reeds were on the left hand side instead of on the right as they break up the reflection, but there isn''t too much you can do about that!  Lovely capture :) Alex', '2005-06-03 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431445, 183021, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract quality of the composition - the red and green shapes created by the narrow DOF.  I wish we could see more detail on your ant - so little of her is in focus and there is a lot of shine and glare.</td>', 'I like the abstract quality of the composition - the red and green shapes created by the narrow DOF.  I wish we could see more detail on your ant - so little of her is in focus and there is a lot of shine and glare.', '2005-06-03 14:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431449, 182649, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very pristine picture - the cool soft water and the rough rock and the sharp red beak - I like the way you have made the composition off center.  Good light, good focus - the bird gets a little lost in the lines of the water.</td>', 'A very pristine picture - the cool soft water and the rough rock and the sharp red beak - I like the way you have made the composition off center.  Good light, good focus - the bird gets a little lost in the lines of the water.', '2005-06-03 14:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431456, 183161, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice division between the falls, the basalt columns at the top and the riot of green and splashing water at the bottom.  Wish the foreground were in sharper focus - the details of the leaves would make a nice contrast the the misty background of the falls.  you must have used a longer exposure to blur the movement of the falls (works nicely!) but the leaves must have been blowing a bit? Lovely green color - Iceland in the summer is beautiful!</td>', 'A nice division between the falls, the basalt columns at the top and the riot of green and splashing water at the bottom.  Wish the foreground were in sharper focus - the details of the leaves would make a nice contrast the the misty background of the falls.  you must have used a longer exposure to blur the movement of the falls (works nicely!) but the leaves must have been blowing a bit? Lovely green color - Iceland in the summer is beautiful!', '2005-06-03 14:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431460, 182782, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the golden green color you''ve captured.  The composition has the quality of an old oil painting.  I''m doing my best to ignore the frame which really distracts me.  The reflections in the water the gray and white clouds suspended in the soft air.  Very beautiful.</td>', 'I love the golden green color you''ve captured.  The composition has the quality of an old oil painting.  I''m doing my best to ignore the frame which really distracts me.  The reflections in the water the gray and white clouds suspended in the soft air.  Very beautiful.', '2005-06-03 14:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431462, 181961, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes and colors - I think cropping on the bottom might make a nicer composition - black on top and bottom draws my eye away from the subject.  Seems a bit blurred.</td>', 'Interesting shapes and colors - I think cropping on the bottom might make a nicer composition - black on top and bottom draws my eye away from the subject.  Seems a bit blurred.', '2005-06-03 14:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
