(1431721, 182643, 7628, '<td valign="top">Iaito is a beautiful and sublte art.  I wish this photo reflected that better.  Light from more than one direction, and at interesting angles would better bring out the details in the sword.  A lower camera angle might create a composition that would fill the frame with the sword and not have so much bland reb background in the shot.</td>', 'Iaito is a beautiful and sublte art.  I wish this photo reflected that better.  Light from more than one direction, and at interesting angles would better bring out the details in the sword.  A lower camera angle might create a composition that would fill the frame with the sword and not have so much bland reb background in the shot.', '2005-06-03 17:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431724, 181311, 7628, '<td valign="top">Softness does work well with these flowers - powder blue all powdery.  But the soft focus effect kind of overpowers the subject.  The first thing I think when I look at the picture is, "soft focus," not "beautiful flowers."</td>', 'Softness does work well with these flowers - powder blue all powdery.  But the soft focus effect kind of overpowers the subject.  The first thing I think when I look at the picture is, "soft focus," not "beautiful flowers."', '2005-06-03 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431737, 182950, 7628, '<td valign="top">What beautiful eyes!  I might crop this photo to one side or the other to bring more attention to her face - the fence in the background draws your eyes right across her face without stopping.  Would like to see more of her hair too - the pretty braids reflect the girliness of the ruffled sleeve and say a lot about her personality - "pink."</td>', 'What beautiful eyes!  I might crop this photo to one side or the other to bring more attention to her face - the fence in the background draws your eyes right across her face without stopping.  Would like to see more of her hair too - the pretty braids reflect the girliness of the ruffled sleeve and say a lot about her personality - "pink."', '2005-06-03 17:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431743, 183019, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the progression from top to bottom - the light and the focus.  I wish there were a bit more to hold my attention in the bottom half of the frame - a poppy closer to the camer and relatively larger or perhaps be father away and have more poppies in the frame (all those soldiers lost!  Perhaps that would work best with your chosen theme)  Lovely red color.</td>', 'I like the progression from top to bottom - the light and the focus.  I wish there were a bit more to hold my attention in the bottom half of the frame - a poppy closer to the camer and relatively larger or perhaps be father away and have more poppies in the frame (all those soldiers lost!  Perhaps that would work best with your chosen theme)  Lovely red color.', '2005-06-03 17:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431753, 183323, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is both unusual and very beautiful.  I like the framing from above - those two heads and those arms and the relationship between them.  The sidewalk provides a nice neutral background.  The black and white pulls it all together rather than have color emphasize the differences between the boys.  The tight cropping emphasizes the movement - and makes you notice how precious and quick the beautiful moment is. 8</td>', 'This is both unusual and very beautiful.  I like the framing from above - those two heads and those arms and the relationship between them.  The sidewalk provides a nice neutral background.  The black and white pulls it all together rather than have color emphasize the differences between the boys.  The tight cropping emphasizes the movement - and makes you notice how precious and quick the beautiful moment is. 8', '2005-06-03 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431759, 181752, 32997, '<td valign="top">Your tones/colours work wonderfully here. Strong entry.</td>', 'Your tones/colours work wonderfully here. Strong entry.', '2005-06-03 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431769, 183226, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun use of color!  The color highlights the contrasts between the two people nad there is a nice sense of movement with the man''s ffet and the breeze in the skirt.  Wish the edge of the skirt weren''t cropped and there were a little more spce on the right to feel they are moving into.</td>', 'Fun use of color!  The color highlights the contrasts between the two people nad there is a nice sense of movement with the man''s ffet and the breeze in the skirt.  Wish the edge of the skirt weren''t cropped and there were a little more spce on the right to feel they are moving into.', '2005-06-03 17:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431772, 183115, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely horizontal composition - the lines of the clouds and the water split by the irregular lines of blue mountains.  That puff of smoke is the perfect detail on the left - adds just a bit of interest for the eye to rest on - the smallness of humanity in the large beauty of nature (Iceland?) 8</td>', 'lovely horizontal composition - the lines of the clouds and the water split by the irregular lines of blue mountains.  That puff of smoke is the perfect detail on the left - adds just a bit of interest for the eye to rest on - the smallness of humanity in the large beauty of nature (Iceland?) 8', '2005-06-03 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431821, 183085, 26756, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, moody and perfectly exposed.  10</td>', 'Gorgeous, moody and perfectly exposed.  10', '2005-06-03 18:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431828, 181170, 26756, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I really like the way you decided to frame this scene.  Beautiful colors. 9</td>', 'Great composition, I really like the way you decided to frame this scene.  Beautiful colors. 9', '2005-06-03 18:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431892, 182715, 31282, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.You took a shot that turned that huge piece of iron into a beautiful thing ! Good luck 7</td>', 'This is a great picture.You took a shot that turned that huge piece of iron into a beautiful thing ! Good luck 7', '2005-06-03 18:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431945, 182809, 6519, '<td valign="top">These D-A-F-F-O-D-I-L-S look very nice. The background is a little cluttered, but  I like the composition.</td>', 'These D-A-F-F-O-D-I-L-S look very nice. The background is a little cluttered, but  I like the composition.', '2005-06-03 19:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431951, 182727, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but the flash (and sharpening ???) makes it look quite harsh.</td>', 'Great subject, but the flash (and sharpening ???) makes it look quite harsh.', '2005-06-03 19:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431975, 183294, 6519, '<td valign="top">Your subject is fantastic, but I wonder if you could have done something more interesting with the composition/background. I guess the car isn''t yours, so you didn''t have much choice re location and lighting...... How about offering the owner a great photo in return for him/her posing the car for you?</td>', 'Your subject is fantastic, but I wonder if you could have done something more interesting with the composition/background. I guess the car isn''t yours, so you didn''t have much choice re location and lighting...... How about offering the owner a great photo in return for him/her posing the car for you?', '2005-06-03 19:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1431989, 183319, 2535, '<td valign="top">THIS BETTER WIN!</td>', 'THIS BETTER WIN!', '2005-06-03 19:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
