(1432005, 183337, 6668, '<td valign="top">I normally would not like a thick grey border like this but with this image I think it works well.</td>', 'I normally would not like a thick grey border like this but with this image I think it works well.', '2005-06-03 19:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
