(1432279, 183270, 17203, '<td valign="top">Gotta be Joey for the dark gothic look. A little too disturbing for my taste because of the doll and "stuff" on the paper, but I think you probably knew that before you submitted. You probably could have scored very well with the same model in a less depressing environment.</td>', 'Gotta be Joey for the dark gothic look. A little too disturbing for my taste because of the doll and "stuff" on the paper, but I think you probably knew that before you submitted. You probably could have scored very well with the same model in a less depressing environment.', '2005-06-03 22:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
