(1432300, 182987, 17203, '<td valign="top">There are several eyes in this challenge, but this may be the best. The blue color is nice, but I wish you had left some color around the edge of the eyelid to add some contrast. 8</td>', 'There are several eyes in this challenge, but this may be the best. The blue color is nice, but I wish you had left some color around the edge of the eyelid to add some contrast. 8', '2005-06-03 22:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
