(1432320, 183333, 30490, '<td valign="top">Your title made me pull out the dictionary and I learned a new word!  Great title and great shot too.  Captures the cat and is made much more interesting by adding your feet.  Overall a good job (7)</td>', 'Your title made me pull out the dictionary and I learned a new word!  Great title and great shot too.  Captures the cat and is made much more interesting by adding your feet.  Overall a good job (7)', '2005-06-03 23:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432343, 183343, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good try at capturing the beautiful ceramic dish. Unfortunately the out of focus mesh distracts from the beautiful  painting on the dish.  Next time be sure to ensure the entire image is in focus too.</td>', 'Good try at capturing the beautiful ceramic dish. Unfortunately the out of focus mesh distracts from the beautiful  painting on the dish.  Next time be sure to ensure the entire image is in focus too.', '2005-06-04 00:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432346, 183283, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of the light and the water spray.  This photo could be improved by being more in focus and not having the light blow out the detail of the rock on the upper left.</td>', 'Interesting capture of the light and the water spray.  This photo could be improved by being more in focus and not having the light blow out the detail of the rock on the upper left.', '2005-06-04 00:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432348, 183293, 30490, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, but I don''t think this qualifies as beautiful in any way.   If this had been a different topic I would have scored it higher, but this doesn''t speak to beauty in my opinion.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, but I don''t think this qualifies as beautiful in any way.   If this had been a different topic I would have scored it higher, but this doesn''t speak to beauty in my opinion.', '2005-06-04 00:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432351, 183178, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great title and subject.  Good use of color.  I would have had all 3 of the main stalks in focus though.  Looking past one out of focus stalk to see the in focus stalk with 2 more out of focus in the back ground isn''t working for me, and hurts my eyes.  Great attempt though, keep trying.</td>', 'Great title and subject.  Good use of color.  I would have had all 3 of the main stalks in focus though.  Looking past one out of focus stalk to see the in focus stalk with 2 more out of focus in the back ground isn''t working for me, and hurts my eyes.  Great attempt though, keep trying.', '2005-06-04 00:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432352, 183270, 30490, '<td valign="top">What about this image is beautiful?  Distrurbing yes.... Dark yes... beautiful, I just don''t see it.  So in my opinion it doesn''t meet the challenge.  As for the photo standing alone.  It is interesting and causes you to look for a while to try to understand everything that is happening in the photo.  This one makes you think and that is a good thing.</td>', 'What about this image is beautiful?  Distrurbing yes.... Dark yes... beautiful, I just don''t see it.  So in my opinion it doesn''t meet the challenge.  As for the photo standing alone.  It is interesting and causes you to look for a while to try to understand everything that is happening in the photo.  This one makes you think and that is a good thing.', '2005-06-04 00:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432355, 182201, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great try here.  The statue is pretty and speaks to the challenge of beauty, but the stark black background, soft focus and flash highlights detract from the image overall.  I would retry this shot with a pretty colored background and see if it improves the overall image.</td>', 'Great try here.  The statue is pretty and speaks to the challenge of beauty, but the stark black background, soft focus and flash highlights detract from the image overall.  I would retry this shot with a pretty colored background and see if it improves the overall image.', '2005-06-04 00:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432357, 182105, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great try, but the sun is blowing out the details of the head and the photo is too grainy for my liking.  Great attempt, keep trying.</td>', 'Great try, but the sun is blowing out the details of the head and the photo is too grainy for my liking.  Great attempt, keep trying.', '2005-06-04 00:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432359, 183324, 17203, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to stand out from so many other flower shots, but the lighting and color on this is absolutely stunning. 10</td>', 'It''s difficult to stand out from so many other flower shots, but the lighting and color on this is absolutely stunning. 10', '2005-06-04 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432360, 182727, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, meets the challenge, but this photo could be improved by having a little clearer detail of the seahorse and less of the plant.  It looks like the camera "saw" the plant more than the true subject of the seahorse.</td>', 'Nice capture, meets the challenge, but this photo could be improved by having a little clearer detail of the seahorse and less of the plant.  It looks like the camera "saw" the plant more than the true subject of the seahorse.', '2005-06-04 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432362, 182546, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice clearly focused shot, but I don''t get the connection to beauty - the challenge topic.  Your title trys to explain, but because I don''t know what I am viewing it isn''t clear to me.  Keep trying and you will do better in your next challenge.</td>', 'Nice clearly focused shot, but I don''t get the connection to beauty - the challenge topic.  Your title trys to explain, but because I don''t know what I am viewing it isn''t clear to me.  Keep trying and you will do better in your next challenge.', '2005-06-04 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432363, 182326, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good subject and the glass is beautiful, but this image doesn''t compare well with other "beautiful" subjects.  I like the background, but the top of the piano isn''t in focus and there are too many blown out parts from the flash.  Keep trying and you will do better in the future.</td>', 'Good subject and the glass is beautiful, but this image doesn''t compare well with other "beautiful" subjects.  I like the background, but the top of the piano isn''t in focus and there are too many blown out parts from the flash.  Keep trying and you will do better in the future.', '2005-06-04 00:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432365, 182202, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I love books too and these are so colorful.  The problem with this image besides the size, is that the gold on the bindings is blown out from the flash.  You might try more indirect lighting or using a flash that isn''t attached to the camera.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'Nice image, I love books too and these are so colorful.  The problem with this image besides the size, is that the gold on the bindings is blown out from the flash.  You might try more indirect lighting or using a flash that isn''t attached to the camera.  Better luck next time.', '2005-06-04 00:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432366, 182751, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice image but I don''t care for the sepia tones.  I would love to see this image in living color and would probably like it much better.</td>', 'Nice image but I don''t care for the sepia tones.  I would love to see this image in living color and would probably like it much better.', '2005-06-04 00:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432367, 183223, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I really don''t care for the infrared treatment.  It looks grainy and detracts from the natural beauty of the glen being photographed.</td>', 'Nice image, but I really don''t care for the infrared treatment.  It looks grainy and detracts from the natural beauty of the glen being photographed.', '2005-06-04 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432368, 183242, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but this image is out of focus and the plant ove the face of the cat is distracting.  Better luck next time and keep trying.</td>', 'Nice try, but this image is out of focus and the plant ove the face of the cat is distracting.  Better luck next time and keep trying.', '2005-06-04 00:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432369, 183301, 17203, '<td valign="top">With all the spectacular sunsets and perfect flowers in this challenge, I commend you for finding real beauty in the mundane. With a little saturation boost I would have voted a higher number than the 9 you''ve earned.</td>', 'With all the spectacular sunsets and perfect flowers in this challenge, I commend you for finding real beauty in the mundane. With a little saturation boost I would have voted a higher number than the 9 you''ve earned.', '2005-06-04 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
