(1432379, 182997, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but the colors seem muted to me and the soft focus on the flower as a whole isn''t working well for me.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice subject, but the colors seem muted to me and the soft focus on the flower as a whole isn''t working well for me.  good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-04 00:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432382, 183319, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, bugs aren''t the high point of beauty in my opinion, but I won''t take away points for that.  This image could be improved by having a sharper focus on the bug and the inner parts of this flower.  Overall a fairly good shot.</td>', 'Interesting subject, bugs aren''t the high point of beauty in my opinion, but I won''t take away points for that.  This image could be improved by having a sharper focus on the bug and the inner parts of this flower.  Overall a fairly good shot.', '2005-06-04 00:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432384, 183261, 30490, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the infrared photos, but that is just my opinion.  this image isn''t saying "beauty" to me maybe due to the lack of natural color.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t care for the infrared photos, but that is just my opinion.  this image isn''t saying "beauty" to me maybe due to the lack of natural color.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-04 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432385, 181752, 17203, '<td valign="top">Spectacular focus and justaposition of color. Since there''s no 12 button, you''ll have to settle for the only other two digit number available to me. ;-)</td>', 'Spectacular focus and justaposition of color. Since there''s no 12 button, you''ll have to settle for the only other two digit number available to me. ;-)', '2005-06-04 00:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432387, 183159, 30490, '<td valign="top">A nice sunset, but it looks grainy to me on my monitor.  This image doesn''t stand out from the many other sunrise/sunset photos in this challenge.  Keep trying and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A nice sunset, but it looks grainy to me on my monitor.  This image doesn''t stand out from the many other sunrise/sunset photos in this challenge.  Keep trying and good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-04 00:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432388, 182984, 30490, '<td valign="top">Ooo we seem to have a focus problem here.  It looks like the leaves on the left are in focus, but the flower and the butterfly are not.   Nice capture of the subject though.</td>', 'Ooo we seem to have a focus problem here.  It looks like the leaves on the left are in focus, but the flower and the butterfly are not.   Nice capture of the subject though.', '2005-06-04 00:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432389, 183181, 17203, '<td valign="top">Freakin'' awesome. Should be in the top 10 easily. With a little more detail in the shadows, a ribbon would be a foregone conclusion. 10</td>', 'Freakin'' awesome. Should be in the top 10 easily. With a little more detail in the shadows, a ribbon would be a foregone conclusion. 10', '2005-06-04 00:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432390, 182976, 30490, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, but too softly focused for my taste.  Also the brown spots on the red rose detract from the beauty overall.</td>', 'Very colorful, but too softly focused for my taste.  Also the brown spots on the red rose detract from the beauty overall.', '2005-06-04 00:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432393, 183165, 30490, '<td valign="top">Looks like a depth of field problem here.  While the inside of the flower is in focus, the eye has a hard time getting past the out of focus petal in the foreground. Keep trying and better luck next time.</td>', 'Looks like a depth of field problem here.  While the inside of the flower is in focus, the eye has a hard time getting past the out of focus petal in the foreground. Keep trying and better luck next time.', '2005-06-04 00:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432394, 182720, 30490, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunrise, but nothing spectacular.  The composition is too centered also.</td>', 'Pretty sunrise, but nothing spectacular.  The composition is too centered also.', '2005-06-04 00:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432396, 183033, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the dictionary background distracts from the beauty of the flower blossom.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the dictionary background distracts from the beauty of the flower blossom.', '2005-06-04 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432397, 182903, 30490, '<td valign="top">beautiful baby, and I like the composition of the image.  I just wish the out of focus foreground had been cropped out of the image. 5</td>', 'beautiful baby, and I like the composition of the image.  I just wish the out of focus foreground had been cropped out of the image. 5', '2005-06-04 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432398, 182763, 17203, '<td valign="top">There are people who spend their entire lives shooting butterflies and never get an image as amazing as this. If you ever meet one of them, show a little compassion and hide this photo. 10</td>', 'There are people who spend their entire lives shooting butterflies and never get an image as amazing as this. If you ever meet one of them, show a little compassion and hide this photo. 10', '2005-06-04 00:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432399, 183197, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wonderful setup shot... the colors, composition, DOF and lighting are all perfect. Sorry I couldn''t be more helpful. 10</td>', 'Wonderful setup shot... the colors, composition, DOF and lighting are all perfect. Sorry I couldn''t be more helpful. 10', '2005-06-04 00:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432401, 183205, 17203, '<td valign="top">Outstanding portrait. Now that makes TWO things you can be proud of. A touch more saturation and maybe a little dodging around the eyes, and it''d be perfect! 9</td>', 'Outstanding portrait. Now that makes TWO things you can be proud of. A touch more saturation and maybe a little dodging around the eyes, and it''d be perfect! 9', '2005-06-04 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
