(1432570, 181953, 35970, '<td valign="top">very nice. the earring seems overdone for her age, but her character saves the shot with her innocent look. The shot would have been just as good with an earring 1/2 the size.</td>', 'very nice. the earring seems overdone for her age, but her character saves the shot with her innocent look. The shot would have been just as good with an earring 1/2 the size.', '2005-06-04 04:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
