(1432634, 182281, 25355, '<td valign="top">Did you know there was someone taking off a point for any title that had the word ''beauty'' in it? Maybe you got around that (but it was easy to google it...)</td>', 'Did you know there was someone taking off a point for any title that had the word ''beauty'' in it? Maybe you got around that (but it was easy to google it...)', '2005-06-04 08:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432636, 182141, 19746, '<td valign="top">You didn''t do too bad a job of trying, though.  Nice work :) It''s always hard to get the exposure right for these because there''s always a risk of blowing out the highlights at the back of the shot, I''ve tried this sort of thing before.  I think you''ve done well here!<br/> <br/>7 and good luck!<br/>Alex</td>', 'You didn''t do too bad a job of trying, though.  Nice work :) It''s always hard to get the exposure right for these because there''s always a risk of blowing out the highlights at the back of the shot, I''ve tried this sort of thing before.  I think you''ve done well here! 7 and good luck!Alex', '2005-06-04 08:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432637, 183195, 19746, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!  Fantastic lighting and the blue colour is absolutely incredible!  The subject might  be a little unappealing for some but I like it.  It''s original, technically sharp, well composed, well lit and very aesthetically pleasing indeed.  An 8 from me - good luck with the challenge.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Very sharp!  Fantastic lighting and the blue colour is absolutely incredible!  The subject might  be a little unappealing for some but I like it.  It''s original, technically sharp, well composed, well lit and very aesthetically pleasing indeed.  An 8 from me - good luck with the challenge. Alex', '2005-06-04 08:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432640, 183317, 25355, '<td valign="top">glory to the dappled things as well, eh</td>', 'glory to the dappled things as well, eh', '2005-06-04 08:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432642, 183327, 19746, '<td valign="top">Jacko-esque.  What an awesome, deep, cherry red.  9 from me and good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Jacko-esque.  What an awesome, deep, cherry red.  9 from me and good luck! Alex', '2005-06-04 08:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432644, 183212, 19746, '<td valign="top">Obscenely shallow DOF but an interesting take on the classic flower shot, nice original spin you''ve managed to put on an old classic.  I like this a lot, 8 from me and good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Obscenely shallow DOF but an interesting take on the classic flower shot, nice original spin you''ve managed to put on an old classic.  I like this a lot, 8 from me and good luck! Alex', '2005-06-04 08:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432647, 183270, 19746, '<td valign="top">Very original take on the challenge, has a lot of shock value.  A little underexposed in parts and a lot of things are hard to discern so you''ll lose some points on the technical side, converesely, the underexposure in parts helps create an eerie, dark mood.<br/> <br/> Beauty is very subjective, especially when voting in accordance to the challenge description.  Good luck with this one.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Very original take on the challenge, has a lot of shock value.  A little underexposed in parts and a lot of things are hard to discern so you''ll lose some points on the technical side, converesely, the underexposure in parts helps create an eerie, dark mood.  Beauty is very subjective, especially when voting in accordance to the challenge description.  Good luck with this one. Alex', '2005-06-04 08:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1432653, 183228, 19746, '<td valign="top">Certainly made me smile!  Fun shot.</td>', 'Certainly made me smile!  Fun shot.', '2005-06-04 08:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
