(1433090, 183031, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details and colors. It''s rating 8 for me here, and would have been higher but for three minor (but crucial) points: 1) the red on the left upper corner, which I think competes too much with the pretty purple and yellow tones, 2) the flare on the right hand side, and 3) the bit of green on the lower left, coupled with the visible strands of cobweb (?).</td>', 'Beautiful details and colors. It''s rating 8 for me here, and would have been higher but for three minor (but crucial) points: 1) the red on the left upper corner, which I think competes too much with the pretty purple and yellow tones, 2) the flare on the right hand side, and 3) the bit of green on the lower left, coupled with the visible strands of cobweb (?).', '2005-06-04 15:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
