(1433099, 183274, 34247, '<td valign="top">Really evocative rays of light. Nice silhouette. Horizon tilt is too evident for a perfect 10 score, and I find myself wishing for a bit more symmetry in terms of details on the tree itself (I feel there''s a bit of imbalance there, with the right side of the frame more lit compared to the left of the tree). As such this is an 8 for me.</td>', 'Really evocative rays of light. Nice silhouette. Horizon tilt is too evident for a perfect 10 score, and I find myself wishing for a bit more symmetry in terms of details on the tree itself (I feel there''s a bit of imbalance there, with the right side of the frame more lit compared to the left of the tree). As such this is an 8 for me.', '2005-06-04 15:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
