(1433370, 183319, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great macro.  I''ll be interested to se the lens or lens combination you used for this.  Clarity and DOF is excellent.  I love the pollen on his/her nose.</td>', 'Wow!  Great macro.  I''ll be interested to se the lens or lens combination you used for this.  Clarity and DOF is excellent.  I love the pollen on his/her nose.', '2005-06-04 18:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433373, 181634, 19936, '<td valign="top">Very brave young lady.  I hope those are pride marks for her.  Good choice of b/w.</td>', 'Very brave young lady.  I hope those are pride marks for her.  Good choice of b/w.', '2005-06-04 18:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433384, 182952, 38789, '<td valign="top">Touching and beautiful.</td>', 'Touching and beautiful.', '2005-06-04 18:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433392, 182550, 3032, '<td valign="top">Where to look?<br/>Well..... (I''m in the mood to be a bit picky)<br/>On the whole you think, wow, what a beauty!<br/>But when you look better at all the parts you wonder what actually the beauty is.<br/>Her face is rather long and in this expression lacks emotion because of the huge space beneath her eyes. The bra is a bit large/long in relation to her breasts. Her tummy is rather flat and lacks interest apart from the piercing.  The legs are quite normal and the arms look skinny. And the transition between tummy and legs is a bit short for my taste and the width of her tummy does not look good with the width of the torso above it. <br/>But why then, when you look at the whole picture, the mind says "beauty". Is it a man thing, is our brain really somehwere else? :)<br/>Photographically I like it a lot. There is a nice balance between dark and light. The face stands out with the locks of hair. The pose is pretty dynamic and daring. 8<br/></td>', 'Where to look?Well..... (I''m in the mood to be a bit picky)On the whole you think, wow, what a beauty!But when you look better at all the parts you wonder what actually the beauty is.Her face is rather long and in this expression lacks emotion because of the huge space beneath her eyes. The bra is a bit large/long in relation to her breasts. Her tummy is rather flat and lacks interest apart from the piercing.  The legs are quite normal and the arms look skinny. And the transition between tummy and legs is a bit short for my taste and the width of her tummy does not look good with the width of the torso above it. But why then, when you look at the whole picture, the mind says "beauty". Is it a man thing, is our brain really somehwere else? :)Photographically I like it a lot. There is a nice balance between dark and light. The face stands out with the locks of hair. The pose is pretty dynamic and daring. 8', '2005-06-04 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433395, 182111, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love how she''s lit on one side, and that her whiskers are lit up. Very nice highlights. NIcely cropped.</td>', 'I love how she''s lit on one side, and that her whiskers are lit up. Very nice highlights. NIcely cropped.', '2005-06-04 19:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433396, 183030, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice, bold architectural statement. I like the strength and simplicity of it...interesting combination.</td>', 'Nice, bold architectural statement. I like the strength and simplicity of it...interesting combination.', '2005-06-04 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433401, 183214, 3032, '<td valign="top">The balance between light and dark is so good here. I love the toning, you''re the duontone guru! (kneels and bows)  ;)<br/>Perhaps the only flaw, perhaps it is insulting to say flaw, is the look as if it has had to much noise reduction. Don''t get me wrong, for this type of photos I like the waterpaint look that is especially visible in the out of focus parts. It has the effect of a painting.<br/>The specks of water work brilliantly, makes the photo more lively.<br/></td>', 'The balance between light and dark is so good here. I love the toning, you''re the duontone guru! (kneels and bows)  ;)Perhaps the only flaw, perhaps it is insulting to say flaw, is the look as if it has had to much noise reduction. Don''t get me wrong, for this type of photos I like the waterpaint look that is especially visible in the out of focus parts. It has the effect of a painting.The specks of water work brilliantly, makes the photo more lively.', '2005-06-04 19:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433402, 181752, 3032, '<td valign="top">Love the near fluorescent colors.</td>', 'Love the near fluorescent colors.', '2005-06-04 19:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433403, 182997, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good composition, love the smooth softness.</td>', 'Good composition, love the smooth softness.', '2005-06-04 19:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
