(1433407, 182798, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the highlights on her eye lashes and bangs. Nice clarity. I don''t know why, but the cropping seems a bit tight. I''m a big macro person, too, so I''m surprized that it''s hitting me that way. Maybe it''s the angle. Overall, I like it. 6</td>', 'I love the highlights on her eye lashes and bangs. Nice clarity. I don''t know why, but the cropping seems a bit tight. I''m a big macro person, too, so I''m surprized that it''s hitting me that way. Maybe it''s the angle. Overall, I like it. 6', '2005-06-04 19:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433411, 183082, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting sylization. It''s almost a sketch. Light, ethereal capture. Very nice.</td>', 'Interesting sylization. It''s almost a sketch. Light, ethereal capture. Very nice.', '2005-06-04 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433417, 183069, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the position of the bird and how it flows along with the clouds.  The compositon of the shot is good.  I find the colours appealing although I feel that the red is a bit oversaturated.  Texture like this are very hard to handle in such small size.  I bet this looks grand full size.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the position of the bird and how it flows along with the clouds.  The compositon of the shot is good.  I find the colours appealing although I feel that the red is a bit oversaturated.  Texture like this are very hard to handle in such small size.  I bet this looks grand full size.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-04 19:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433420, 181311, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus of the flowers, and I like the line that the blue ones make. I think the composition is harmed, however, by the row of 6 purple flowers in the back. Not a pretty line. The 3 purple flowers most forward are nice. <br/></td>', 'I like the soft focus of the flowers, and I like the line that the blue ones make. I think the composition is harmed, however, by the row of 6 purple flowers in the back. Not a pretty line. The 3 purple flowers most forward are nice. ', '2005-06-04 19:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433421, 182693, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is stunning! I love the light and pattern on the dune. I  think it would look even better without the tree, just the dune and the sky but that''s just me! Good luck</td>', 'This is stunning! I love the light and pattern on the dune. I  think it would look even better without the tree, just the dune and the sky but that''s just me! Good luck', '2005-06-04 19:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
