(1433571, 183197, 35947, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting!</td>', 'Amazing lighting!', '2005-06-04 21:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433598, 183302, 8377, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, nice dof, very vivid colors. beautiful model. I would not change one thing about the photo -10</td>', 'Beautiful image, nice dof, very vivid colors. beautiful model. I would not change one thing about the photo -10', '2005-06-04 22:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433599, 182986, 8377, '<td valign="top">lovely image, color choice very nice for the photo. makes me want ot know what she is looking at :)  i may have cropped out the person to the far right, but thats just me.  still one of my absolute favs in the challenge</td>', 'lovely image, color choice very nice for the photo. makes me want ot know what she is looking at :)  i may have cropped out the person to the far right, but thats just me.  still one of my absolute favs in the challenge', '2005-06-04 22:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433600, 182543, 8377, '<td valign="top">Giraffe! Never really thought of giraffes as beautiful, but you make me think otherwise. Great job on the photo! The giraffe really pops against the green bkg. Excellent choice of dof, great clarity. Wouldnt change anything.</td>', 'Giraffe! Never really thought of giraffes as beautiful, but you make me think otherwise. Great job on the photo! The giraffe really pops against the green bkg. Excellent choice of dof, great clarity. Wouldnt change anything.', '2005-06-04 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433603, 183212, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 Commend you for going beyond the norm and trying something different and unique.<br/>Composition: 10 Leading line works very well in this shot.<br/>Technical: The soft bokeh effect just looks very charming. <br/>Creativity: 10 This by far is the most unique flower shot I have seen and with the soft focus it makes that much better.<br/>Overall: 10 I really hope to ribbon. I would like to see a soft focus image get top honors. DPC tends to stick to clean and sharp and this really has more to offer.</td>', 'Challenge: 10 Commend you for going beyond the norm and trying something different and unique.Composition: 10 Leading line works very well in this shot.Technical: The soft bokeh effect just looks very charming. Creativity: 10 This by far is the most unique flower shot I have seen and with the soft focus it makes that much better.Overall: 10 I really hope to ribbon. I would like to see a soft focus image get top honors. DPC tends to stick to clean and sharp and this really has more to offer.', '2005-06-04 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433607, 182655, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 Sunflowers are just really beautiful and are awesome to shoot.<br/>Technical: 10 Very sharp image.<br/>Composition: 10 I like how you added the blue sky for an effect.<br/>Creativity: 6 Unfortunatly I have to hammer you on this as I have seen images else where.<br/>Overall: 9 Good luck</td>', 'Challenge: 10 Sunflowers are just really beautiful and are awesome to shoot.Technical: 10 Very sharp image.Composition: 10 I like how you added the blue sky for an effect.Creativity: 6 Unfortunatly I have to hammer you on this as I have seen images else where.Overall: 9 Good luck', '2005-06-04 22:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433611, 182798, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 7 I just dont see this as beautiful.<br/>Compostion: 8 The leading line works well here but I think the eye is just too centered in this shot. Maybe changing the angle to the eye would have changed the feel.<br/>Technical: 10 The image is very sharp and at the same time the DOF works very well for this sort of shot.<br/>Creativity: 10 I would''nt have been this close to a horse.<br/>Overall: 8 Good luck</td>', 'Challenge: 7 I just dont see this as beautiful.Compostion: 8 The leading line works well here but I think the eye is just too centered in this shot. Maybe changing the angle to the eye would have changed the feel.Technical: 10 The image is very sharp and at the same time the DOF works very well for this sort of shot.Creativity: 10 I would''nt have been this close to a horse.Overall: 8 Good luck', '2005-06-04 22:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433615, 182649, 30625, '<td valign="top">Thats a beauty. The reflection is just awesome. The colors look to the point. Very well captured. Good job 10</td>', 'Thats a beauty. The reflection is just awesome. The colors look to the point. Very well captured. Good job 10', '2005-06-04 22:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433634, 183158, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 7 Just not givin me the feeling for beauty. <br/>Composition: 10 The diagonal leading line works very well. The DOF is excellent of this kind of shot.<br/>Technical: 10 The image is very sharp. <br/>Post-Processing: 10 The selective desaturation works very well with this shot. Very impressive.<br/>Creativity: 8 for guts on trying a shot of this nature for this sort of a challenge.<br/>Overall: 9<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 7 Just not givin me the feeling for beauty. Composition: 10 The diagonal leading line works very well. The DOF is excellent of this kind of shot.Technical: 10 The image is very sharp. Post-Processing: 10 The selective desaturation works very well with this shot. Very impressive.Creativity: 8 for guts on trying a shot of this nature for this sort of a challenge.Overall: 9', '2005-06-04 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433659, 182357, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action photo!  Just enough of a blur on the tip of the wings to show they are in motion, and everything else is frozen solid.  And with such shallow DOF, the focus had to be perfect.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice stop action photo!  Just enough of a blur on the tip of the wings to show they are in motion, and everything else is frozen solid.  And with such shallow DOF, the focus had to be perfect.  Nice shot!', '2005-06-04 22:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433662, 182902, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the silhouettes on the right in contrast to the softness of the sunset.</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the silhouettes on the right in contrast to the softness of the sunset.', '2005-06-04 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433674, 182599, 19982, '<td valign="top">I always prefer animals that look like they are coming towards you rather than fleeing away...  So while I like the angle here, I wish they were swimming towards you so we could see the front rather than the back. Now for the tricky part...  I''d also prefer to see the eyes a little sharper, but be careful not to sharpen the water (makes it look hard and unnaturall).  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I always prefer animals that look like they are coming towards you rather than fleeing away...  So while I like the angle here, I wish they were swimming towards you so we could see the front rather than the back. Now for the tricky part...  I''d also prefer to see the eyes a little sharper, but be careful not to sharpen the water (makes it look hard and unnaturall).  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-04 23:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433678, 183307, 23478, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image... the horizon is slightly tilted (runs "downhill"  to the left), also maybe shifting the angle so the moon would not be centered may have made it more interesting.  Good shot.</td>', 'Beautiful image... the horizon is slightly tilted (runs "downhill"  to the left), also maybe shifting the angle so the moon would not be centered may have made it more interesting.  Good shot.', '2005-06-04 23:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433683, 182782, 19982, '<td valign="top">Ah oh, better watch out for the border police.  (I know, I''m late in voting, you''ve probably already received a ton of remarks)  Well...  I, for one, happen to like your border.  Hopefully I''m not the only one.  The actual picture looks nice. I kinda would like a little more contrast around the purple flowers, just to make them more distinct.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Ah oh, better watch out for the border police.  (I know, I''m late in voting, you''ve probably already received a ton of remarks)  Well...  I, for one, happen to like your border.  Hopefully I''m not the only one.  The actual picture looks nice. I kinda would like a little more contrast around the purple flowers, just to make them more distinct.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-04 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433686, 183158, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2005-06-04 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433687, 182209, 23478, '<td valign="top">Wonderful angle and contrast with the greens &amp; blues.</td>', 'Wonderful angle and contrast with the greens & blues.', '2005-06-04 23:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433689, 182925, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail.</td>', 'Excellent detail.', '2005-06-04 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433690, 183137, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but seems slightly OOF.</td>', 'This is nice, but seems slightly OOF.', '2005-06-04 23:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
