(1433735, 182729, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but the border is distracting from the subject of the image. The left foreground is a little out of focus too.  Overall a nice photo. 5</td>', 'Nice capture but the border is distracting from the subject of the image. The left foreground is a little out of focus too.  Overall a nice photo. 5', '2005-06-04 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
