(1433749, 181386, 30490, '<td valign="top">Pretty but ordinary when compared to some of the other shots in this challenge.  I am giving this image a 5 because it is clear and a good quality, it just isn''t as creative as other images.</td>', 'Pretty but ordinary when compared to some of the other shots in this challenge.  I am giving this image a 5 because it is clear and a good quality, it just isn''t as creative as other images.', '2005-06-05 00:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
