(1434155, 182902, 19746, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure you''re going to ribbon with this one.  You''ve nailed this shot brilliantly...  Nicely composed although I might have cropped a little bit off the left.  Taking nothing away from this scene...one of my few 10s in this challenge and I sincerely hope you ribbon with this one!<br/> <br/>Alex.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure you''re going to ribbon with this one.  You''ve nailed this shot brilliantly...  Nicely composed although I might have cropped a little bit off the left.  Taking nothing away from this scene...one of my few 10s in this challenge and I sincerely hope you ribbon with this one! Alex.', '2005-06-05 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434157, 183307, 19746, '<td valign="top">I love this, reminds me of The Doors song Moonlight Drive.  I would have liked it if you cloned out that light furthrest to the right, and maybe got  the lit path to end where the moon''s reflected light begins by moving to the left when shooting this (but there would be other compositional compromises, no doubt) as it would make it seem like an extension of the path.  <br/> <br/>This is fantastic, anyway, however. <br/> <br/>4/4 For the challenge<br/>3/3 For Aesthetics<br/>2/2 For Originality<br/>1/1 For the WOW factor <br/> <br/>Oh...10 - nice one :) I hope you ribbon with this distinctly unique  enty.  <br/> <br/>Alex<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this, reminds me of The Doors song Moonlight Drive.  I would have liked it if you cloned out that light furthrest to the right, and maybe got  the lit path to end where the moon''s reflected light begins by moving to the left when shooting this (but there would be other compositional compromises, no doubt) as it would make it seem like an extension of the path.   This is fantastic, anyway, however.  4/4 For the challenge3/3 For Aesthetics2/2 For Originality1/1 For the WOW factor  Oh...10 - nice one :) I hope you ribbon with this distinctly unique  enty.   Alex ', '2005-06-05 10:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434175, 181357, 35352, '<td valign="top">I lke the pockets of colour in this photo. I notice my eyes jumping from one of them to the next. The water dropets are also nice even if they are seen though the flowers. I also like the white light shining through the top set of flowers - it looks good as well as breaking up the photo.</td>', 'I lke the pockets of colour in this photo. I notice my eyes jumping from one of them to the next. The water dropets are also nice even if they are seen though the flowers. I also like the white light shining through the top set of flowers - it looks good as well as breaking up the photo.', '2005-06-05 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
