(1436128, 183074, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good job removing the aircraft and animals - can''t see any trace of them.  Nice image, I agree with some other commenters that it''s a bit bottom heavy - it''s a shame because with a bit different crop, who knows, could have made top ten?</td>', 'Good job removing the aircraft and animals - can''t see any trace of them.  Nice image, I agree with some other commenters that it''s a bit bottom heavy - it''s a shame because with a bit different crop, who knows, could have made top ten?', '2005-06-06 08:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1436159, 182913, 7628, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo - one of my highest rated in the challenge.  Can''t believe it isn''t higher up!  It has a wonderful quality of warm memories.  I love the composition with the dog''s nose in the bottom corner and the balance of the white shaggy fur and the girls dark hair.</td>', 'I really liked this photo - one of my highest rated in the challenge.  Can''t believe it isn''t higher up!  It has a wonderful quality of warm memories.  I love the composition with the dog''s nose in the bottom corner and the balance of the white shaggy fur and the girls dark hair.', '2005-06-06 08:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1436168, 183323, 7628, '<td valign="top">Well perhaps this was so imaginative people couldn''t see it as typical "beauty."  It was one of my favorites of the challenge - still is!</td>', 'Well perhaps this was so imaginative people couldn''t see it as typical "beauty."  It was one of my favorites of the challenge - still is!', '2005-06-06 08:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
