(1436276, 183085, 18932, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning. If that''s your first with the lens, everyone else''s chance at a ribbon has decreased greatly. I''d love to see this in print!</td>', 'Simply stunning. If that''s your first with the lens, everyone else''s chance at a ribbon has decreased greatly. I''d love to see this in print!', '2005-06-06 09:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
