(1437832, 182952, 5286, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo! Very arresting, esp. when opened up to full size. The composition as well as the contrast between the two people is ideal. And the fact that the face of the mother is completely covered by the little girl''s, with no detail showing at all, really really adds to the picture. Great job!</td>', 'An excellent photo! Very arresting, esp. when opened up to full size. The composition as well as the contrast between the two people is ideal. And the fact that the face of the mother is completely covered by the little girl''s, with no detail showing at all, really really adds to the picture. Great job!', '2005-06-06 22:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
