(1438266, 182550, 19708, '<td valign="top">Guess I''m the odd guy out in the crowd.<br/>Technically the shot has a lot of merit in the lighting &amp; levels, pose is not to my liking, but that''s me.<br/>What does bug me here is the look in her eyes. There is a somewhat "stoned" look in my opinion, and that coupled with the pose, makes the overall appearance look a bit, and forgive my being blunt here, trashy.<br/>An attractive woman''s face simply lights up with a genuine smile.<br/>Perfect example of what I am referring to is a shot in your wonderful porfolio:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=140026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/24921/thumb/140026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/24921/thumb/140026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/24921/thumb/140026.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Just my personal opinion, and my step out on the limb of honesty.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-07 02:22:16.</i></td>', 'Guess I''m the odd guy out in the crowd.Technically the shot has a lot of merit in the lighting & levels, pose is not to my liking, but that''s me.What does bug me here is the look in her eyes. There is a somewhat "stoned" look in my opinion, and that coupled with the pose, makes the overall appearance look a bit, and forgive my being blunt here, trashy.An attractive woman''s face simply lights up with a genuine smile.Perfect example of what I am referring to is a shot in your wonderful porfolio:  Just my personal opinion, and my step out on the limb of honesty.', '2005-06-07 03:18:40.000000', '2005-06-07 03:22:16.000000', 0),
