(1438683, 182716, 14789, '<td valign="top">my only gripe with this image, having worked with photoshop extensively is her hair is pretty much invisible against the black portion of the curtain. I wish i could see more of her hair highlights. She is a beautiful model indeed and very well shot. It has the essence of erotica and innocence. Perhaps you could use PS''s dodge tool, or use layers and use screen overlay to bring her hair highlights. <br/> <br/>I do hope you have not used contrast adjustment and saved the JPG, if so the image would be permanently destroyed of its original information.</td>', 'my only gripe with this image, having worked with photoshop extensively is her hair is pretty much invisible against the black portion of the curtain. I wish i could see more of her hair highlights. She is a beautiful model indeed and very well shot. It has the essence of erotica and innocence. Perhaps you could use PS''s dodge tool, or use layers and use screen overlay to bring her hair highlights.  I do hope you have not used contrast adjustment and saved the JPG, if so the image would be permanently destroyed of its original information.', '2005-06-07 11:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1438695, 183212, 19746, '<td valign="top">WHAAAAAT!? How did this end up down here?  Compared to some of the other less interestingly composed flower shots that placed top 30...<br/> <br/>Very strange, I agree with e301.  Good luck for the future.</td>', 'WHAAAAAT!? How did this end up down here?  Compared to some of the other less interestingly composed flower shots that placed top 30... Very strange, I agree with e301.  Good luck for the future.', '2005-06-07 12:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
