(1440196, 182211, 93, '<td valign="top">Damn.. My predictions are HOT.. I predicted 6.0 - 6.2 for Silhouettes II and got a 6.2.. and now 5.2 - 5.5 and got a 5.2!  I ROCK<br/> <br/>I didn''t predict a score for my Naturally Framed entry though.. and dunno if I will for "Birds".. but hey, at least I''m beginning to understand DPC a bit better. lol.<br/> <br/>As for this entry.. wow.. 21 comments.. I wasn''t expecting that.<br/> <br/>Beagle, I saw the white speck after the challenge had started, but to be honest, if people are really looking that closely and are that concerned with an image being *THAT* bloody flawless.. fuck em. I don''t need a high score that bad.<br/> <br/>Anyway, someone said I should stop swearing..<br/> <br/>NAAAAHHH!!</td>', 'Damn.. My predictions are HOT.. I predicted 6.0 - 6.2 for Silhouettes II and got a 6.2.. and now 5.2 - 5.5 and got a 5.2!  I ROCK I didn''t predict a score for my Naturally Framed entry though.. and dunno if I will for "Birds".. but hey, at least I''m beginning to understand DPC a bit better. lol. As for this entry.. wow.. 21 comments.. I wasn''t expecting that. Beagle, I saw the white speck after the challenge had started, but to be honest, if people are really looking that closely and are that concerned with an image being *THAT* bloody flawless.. fuck em. I don''t need a high score that bad. Anyway, someone said I should stop swearing.. NAAAAHHH!!', '2005-06-08 03:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
