(1440736, 182188, 31443, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your comments and well wishes. It sure was exciting to win suddenly 2 ribbons in a row. Although always hoping, I never imagined getting this high scores so soon, it will be really hard to keep up the momentum. What happened to me and my winning shots just goes to show everyone that you need alot of stubborness and retake your shots often until you get it right. The beautiful horses in my photograph are simply beauty in it''s most natural form, I happened to be there to witness this beauty. I''ve uploaded lots more in my portfolio under the title of Royal Stables in Amman, if anyone would like to see more.<br/>Thanks again and all these wonderful comments mean so much to me, Gurry aka Xilebo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-08 09:48:10.</i></td>', 'Thank you everyone for your comments and well wishes. It sure was exciting to win suddenly 2 ribbons in a row. Although always hoping, I never imagined getting this high scores so soon, it will be really hard to keep up the momentum. What happened to me and my winning shots just goes to show everyone that you need alot of stubborness and retake your shots often until you get it right. The beautiful horses in my photograph are simply beauty in it''s most natural form, I happened to be there to witness this beauty. I''ve uploaded lots more in my portfolio under the title of Royal Stables in Amman, if anyone would like to see more.Thanks again and all these wonderful comments mean so much to me, Gurry aka Xilebo.', '2005-06-08 10:45:15.000000', '2005-06-08 10:48:10.000000', 0),
