(1471439, 183325, 31606, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs. in your portfolio.  If I would have voted on this challenge I would have given you a 9.  Only because of the one bright spot on the left in the dark part of the clouds.  I find that distracting and it probably would work better if you could clone that out.  You have nice bright colors and a great silhouette.  Excellent capture and very print worthy.</td>', 'This is one of my favs. in your portfolio.  If I would have voted on this challenge I would have given you a 9.  Only because of the one bright spot on the left in the dark part of the clouds.  I find that distracting and it probably would work better if you could clone that out.  You have nice bright colors and a great silhouette.  Excellent capture and very print worthy.', '2005-06-21 15:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
