(1588717, 183223, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I understand why photos do well or poorly at DPC.  Frequently my tastes are very different from those of the crowd here.  This is a perfect example.  I really love this photo.  It captures an essential tranquil quality of the woodland garden that is very rarely captured well.  I believe this photo deserved to score much better; but whatever the score, thanks for sharing it.  It really is quite beautiful.</td>', 'Sometimes I understand why photos do well or poorly at DPC.  Frequently my tastes are very different from those of the crowd here.  This is a perfect example.  I really love this photo.  It captures an essential tranquil quality of the woodland garden that is very rarely captured well.  I believe this photo deserved to score much better; but whatever the score, thanks for sharing it.  It really is quite beautiful.', '2005-08-05 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
