(5550085, 182776, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zigomar:</b></div><hr/><i> This photo has been intriguing me for years, I swear. The girl is really beautiful. I first saw it 3 years ago and I think of it from time to time. I guess this is La Jolla? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>thank you Milosh! Yes it is La Jolla. The editing of this photo is really bad (I don''t know what happened to my monitor when I worked on it), but you''re right - the girl is beautiful (it''s a daughter of my friends). Here is a better rendition of this photo<br/> <br/><a href="//www.levtsimring.com/v/people/color/alisa_www.jpg.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Alisa</a> <br/> <br/>are a couple of other shots of her done at different times<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=616022" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/616022.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/616022.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/616022.jpg"/></a> and <a href="//www.levtsimring.com/v/people/color/alisa1_www.jpg.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> <br/>...and this is her mom :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=450019" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/614/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_450019.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/614/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_450019.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/614/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_450019.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Zigomar: This photo has been intriguing me for years, I swear. The girl is really beautiful. I first saw it 3 years ago and I think of it from time to time. I guess this is La Jolla?  thank you Milosh! Yes it is La Jolla. The editing of this photo is really bad (I don''t know what happened to my monitor when I worked on it), but you''re right - the girl is beautiful (it''s a daughter of my friends). Here is a better rendition of this photo Alisa  are a couple of other shots of her done at different times and this ...and this is her mom :) ', '2009-06-29 20:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641174, 182357, 110015, '<td valign="top">This is such an effective shot! I see we have a favourite subject in common - and thank you for the lovely comment on my hummer (first comment I''ve received so far). I tend not to edit much either. Then again, I don''t really know how to do advanced edits. I like the naturalness of your image; one can easily imagine the texture of the feathers. The light falling through the wings is beautiful, too.</td>', 'This is such an effective shot! I see we have a favourite subject in common - and thank you for the lovely comment on my hummer (first comment I''ve received so far). I tend not to edit much either. Then again, I don''t really know how to do advanced edits. I like the naturalness of your image; one can easily imagine the texture of the feathers. The light falling through the wings is beautiful, too.', '2009-09-09 00:48:14.000000', NULL, 0),
